TEXT(R"MAINSTORY({"schema_version":1,"characters":{"narrator":{"name":"旁白","appearance":"","reference":""},"hero":{"name":"主角","appearance":"Young adult Chinese male traveler, thick dark eyebrows, black topknot with brown ribbon, brown short jacket, grey-blue crossed tunic and loose trousers, cloth leg wraps, brown shoes, bamboo travel basket and bamboo pole. Match the hero in the campfire reference exactly; no sword or armor.","reference":"SourceAssets/CharacterVisuals/final_selected_v1/00_hero.png"},"you_bai":{"name":"幽白","appearance":"One compact floating blue-lavender spirit flame with pointed flowing flame silhouette, sharp expressive eyes and smug face. No human body, no arms, no legs, no clothes. Match the blue spirit reference.","reference":"SourceAssets/CharacterVisuals/final_selected_v1/09_yue_bai.png"},"zhou_guang_zu":{"name":"周光祖","appearance":"Adult Chinese herbal scholar with extremely broad straw hat, black robe, jade-green trousers, long curled black mustache and narrow goatee, bamboo scroll, and one orange fox draped around his shoulders. Match the reference.","reference":"SourceAssets/CharacterVisuals/final_selected_v1/10_zhou_guang_zu.png"},"jin_gui":{"name":"金贵","appearance":"Slim adult Chinese wanderer with sleepy sly eyes, short black hair, wide straw hat bearing a small red leaf ornament, faded jade-green robe and trousers, waist pouch, long bamboo smoking pipe. Match the reference.","reference":"SourceAssets/CharacterVisuals/final_selected_v1/11_jin_gui.png"},"tusi":{"name":"土司首领","appearance":"Broad older Chinese mountain chief with an angular broad straw hat, huge white outward-curled mustache and short white goatee, ochre-brown tunic, black trim, large red-orange cape and fork-topped wooden staff. Match the reference.","reference":"SourceAssets/CharacterVisuals/final_selected_v1/07_tusi_chief.png"},"song_jin_bao":{"name":"宋金宝","appearance":"Lean adult Chinese man with long lively face, mischievous smile, sharply peaked straw hat, red-orange long coat with ochre patterned front panel, brown trousers and waist pouch. Three plain paper slips can be held like a fan; match the reference.","reference":"SourceAssets/CharacterVisuals/final_selected_v1/08_song_jin_bao.png"},"qiong_yao_er":{"name":"琼幺儿","appearance":"Young adult Chinese mountain woman, dark expressive eyes, black side braid, cream round cap ringed with white beads and red top ornament, red-orange jacket, ochre long skirt, cream waist scarf with trailing red-cream ribbons, small bronze hand bell and green carved bell charm. Match the reference, no new headdress.","reference":"SourceAssets/CharacterVisuals/final_selected_v1/12_qiong_mei_er.png"},"driver":{"name":"老车夫","appearance":"Weathered middle-aged Chinese coachman, square face, short stubble, dark cloth cap, grey-brown short robe, rope belt and worn cloth shoes. A rolled driving whip at belt. Supporting story character, no vehicle needed.","reference":""},"mountain_man":{"name":"行脚山客","appearance":"Thin elderly Chinese mountain traveler, white short beard, plain grey headcloth, faded ochre robe, walking stick and a small cloth bundle of map papers.","reference":""},"abbot":{"name":"国清寺住持","appearance":"Kind stout elderly Chinese monk, bald head, long white eyebrows, faded ochre and grey robes, simple wooden prayer beads, friendly knowing expression.","reference":""},"innkeeper":{"name":"古怪掌柜","appearance":"Round-faced middle-aged Chinese innkeeper, small neat mustache, indigo cloth headwrap and indigo robe, tan apron, a wooden abacus and a tea cloth.","reference":""},"woodcutter":{"name":"樵夫","appearance":"Stocky middle-aged Chinese woodcutter, grey-brown patched short jacket, dark cloth headband, straw sandals, modest firewood bundle and blunt woodcutting axe kept safely aside.","reference":""},"hunter":{"name":"失足猎人","appearance":"Lean adult Chinese mountain hunter, plain brown headband, olive-brown short coat, dark trousers and cloth gaiters, modest bow and quiver. Ankle lightly wrapped after rescue. Different person from Zhou Guangzu.","reference":""},"willow_scholar":{"name":"垂柳先生","appearance":"Thin elderly Chinese scholar with white eyebrows and short beard, pale grey long robe, dark soft cap, a willow-twig brush and small plain notebook. Calm and dryly humorous.","reference":""},"boatman":{"name":"船夫","appearance":"Sturdy middle-aged Chinese river boatman with a short mustache, weathered face, round straw hat, rolled-sleeve blue-grey work robe, dark trousers, a long bamboo pole and a simple wooden skiff.","reference":""},"villager":{"name":"江湾村民","appearance":"Friendly adult Chinese farmer in tan-grey homespun clothing, dark headcloth, rolled sleeves and simple cloth shoes, carrying a water bucket or farming tool as required by the scene.","reference":""},"elder":{"name":"江湾村长","appearance":"Small elderly Chinese village elder, white short beard, ochre cloth cap and modest brown robe, wooden cane and a carefully wrapped old map scroll.","reference":""},"poor_traveler":{"name":"老行人","appearance":"Poor elderly Chinese traveler in a faded blue patched robe and soft grey cap, small cloth food bag, gentle weathered face, dignified and grateful rather than caricatured.","reference":""},"porter":{"name":"脚夫","appearance":"Stocky adult Chinese porter with thick uneven eyebrows, short black mustache, brown headcloth, grey-brown short tunic, dusty blue trousers, rope belt and cloth shoulder bag. No straw hat or green robe; clearly distinct from Jin Gui.","reference":""}},"chapters":[{"id":"S00","title":"天台山·祖传也会指错路","summary":"一阵山风吹醒守图灵，也吹破了祖传地图绝不会错的体面。救下的不是一卷圣旨，而是一张允许继续改的图。","stage_number":1,"mainline_end":"S00-06","nodes":[{"id":"S00-01","title":"天台山脚","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"你还在和车夫讲价，祖传地图已经抢先上山。第一件江湖大事：追上自己的行程。","script_revision":2,"objective":"问清上山方向，整理旧抄图","requires_all":[],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["narrator","天台山脚，你展开祖父留下的旧图，打算先找条体面的上山路。"],["driver","沿溪，过桥，往国清寺去。山路不收车钱，专收腿。"],["hero","你把这话写在车上，生意还能剩几成？"],["narrator","你转身讲价的工夫，一阵山风从卷轴底下钻过，把整张图托了起来。"],["hero","哎！我还没出发，路线怎么先跑了！"],["driver","好图，有自己的打算。"],["narrator","你拎着竹竿追向浅溪。车夫没追，先替你按住了滚到脚边的墨盒。"],["driver","方向记牢了再追！图捞回来，膝盖可没地方补。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意问清上山方向，整理旧抄图。","这一步要做的是：问清上山方向，整理旧抄图。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：已问清沿溪上山的方向，旧图被风吹向浅溪。"],"result":"已问清沿溪上山的方向，旧图被风吹向浅溪。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":5},"art":{"node_id":"S00-01","file":"s00_01_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["driver","hero"],"scene":"A brisk low diagonal action shot at the Tiantai stream bank. The hero lunges sideways with his bamboo pole after a broad wind-lifted paper map, one foot braced safely on a rock. The coachman at the opposite near corner calmly pins the rolling ink box beneath his shoe and calls after him. The map and their opposed gazes connect the whole frame. A large clean wind curve, two pale mountain shapes and very few props. No spirit, no carriage, no drowning or lost scroll.","mood":"Lighthearted Chinese wuxia comedy, relaxed relief after a small success.","key_moment":"路线比人先出发：主角飞身追图，车夫稳稳替他踩住墨盒。","camera":"low diagonal action, near/far counterpoint","facts":["主角已问清沿溪上山方向。","幽白尚未现身；旧图正被风吹向可捞回的浅溪，没有毁坏。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S00_01.T_Story_S00_01"}},{"id":"S00-02","title":"获得卷轴","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"竹竿挑回了湿图，也挑出一团满肚子官腔的火。你差点当场认了个缩水祖父。","script_revision":2,"objective":"拾回卷轴，认识幽白","requires_all":["S00-01"],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["hero","才出门就洗祖业，祖父知道了怕是要冒烟。"],["narrator","竹竿一挑，湿卷摊开。蓝紫色灵火从两条旧批注之间蹿出来，正撞上你的鼻尖。"],["hero","祖父？你怎么……缩水了？"],["you_bai","认亲先停！本座幽白，守图之灵，不负责给你添辈分。"],["hero","那你从我祖父的图里出来，总得有个说法。"],["you_bai","这卷图历代有人抄，也历代有人改。本座看着他们落笔，睡醒一觉，竟轮到你来泡澡。"],["narrator","你翻到卷背，果然看见几种深浅不同的旧笔迹。幽白挡在最歪的一笔前，催你赶路。"],["you_bai","先去国清寺核对旧路！还有，别对着本座叫祖父，听着显老。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意拾回卷轴，认识幽白。","这一步要做的是：拾回卷轴，认识幽白。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：卷轴已拾回，幽白现身同行，决定前往国清寺核对旧路。"],"result":"卷轴已拾回，幽白现身)MAINSTORY"),
TEXT(R"MAINSTORY(同行，决定前往国清寺核对旧路。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":5},"art":{"node_id":"S00-02","file":"s00_02_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["hero","you_bai"],"scene":"Tight three-quarter character reveal at a shallow creek. The intact damp scroll is hooked on the hero's raised bamboo pole; a single bodiless blue-purple flame bursts from its fold close to his face. The hero jerks his head and shoulders back with a wonderfully mistaken look of recognition while the small spirit leans forward in affronted grandeur. Their two faces and the open roll dominate, no extra limbs on the spirit, only two clean water arcs. This is the startling first encounter, not a calm introduction after it.","mood":"A startling reveal immediately punctured by ridiculous mistaken identity; bright, clean and playful.","key_moment":"竹竿挑出一团火，主角脱口喊祖父，幽白当场炸毛。","camera":"tight three-quarter reveal","facts":["拾回卷轴，认识幽白","卷轴已拾回，幽白现身同行，决定前往国清寺核对旧路。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S00_02.T_Story_S00_02"}},{"id":"S00-03","title":"越过山肩","kind":"Investigation","summary":"幽白刚宣布旧图绝不会错，桥就当着它的面掉了一块板。前辈的体面和你的脚，得先保一个。","script_revision":2,"objective":"根据脚印与路标选择安全上山路","requires_all":["S00-02"],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["you_bai","前方过桥。这一段本座记得，闭着眼都——"],["narrator","咔。桥上最后一块松板翻了下去。你把抬起的脚收回来，幽白把没说完的话咽回去。"],["hero","闭着眼，都听得见它塌。"],["you_bai","桥没有认真执行地图。"],["hero","图全对，山河全责？这回先请脚底板表个态。"],["narrator","右边藤坡滑着青苔。左边松根石阶挂着旧青布，泥上留着新脚印；有人已经从那里上山。"],["you_bai","等会儿。新脚印旁没有折返的印子……这条应当走得通。"],["hero","这句算证据。前辈，再来两句这种的。"]],"options":[{"text":"走挂青布、留有新脚印的松根石阶","correct":true,"feedback":"幽白这次看了脚印才点头。你们走上石阶，把断桥留在身后。"},{"text":"相信祖传地图，从断桥跳过去","correct":false,"feedback":"幽白立刻拦住你：本座负责认路，不负责把人拼回去。"},{"text":"沿满是青苔的藤坡直上","correct":false,"feedback":"你用竹竿一试，苔皮整片滑落。腿没有比竹竿多长一双眼。"}],"hints":["先看哪条路近期有人走过。","青布石阶有新脚印，而且没有折返印；断桥和青苔坡都不稳。","选择‘走挂青布、留有新脚印的松根石阶’。"],"result":"沿有新脚印的松根石阶安全越过山肩，记下断桥与绕行路。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":5},"art":{"node_id":"S00-03","file":"s00_03_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["you_bai","hero"],"scene":"A high oblique view of the fork at the exact instant the false route loses authority. One large loose bridge plank flips downward in the far side of the composition. The hero plants his staff and draws his raised foot back onto solid ground, already turning his body toward the left stone stairs with a blue-cloth marker and clear fresh footprints. Youbai hangs frozen over the failed bridge approach, then follows the hero's gaze. No one falls or jumps. Use one bold plank shape, not debris particles.","mood":"Lighthearted Chinese wuxia comedy, relaxed relief after a small success.","key_moment":"幽白的话没说完，桥板先给出了反对意见。","camera":"high oblique fork with a sudden moving plank","facts":["根据脚印与路标选择安全上山路","沿有新脚印的松根石阶安全越过山肩，记下断桥与绕行路。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S00_03.T_Story_S00_03"}},{"id":"S00-04","title":"初次战斗","kind":"JourneyBattle","summary":"山客的手稿被兽群围住了。你以为它们要抢奇书，翻开纸背才发现：老人拿稿子包过芝麻饼。","script_revision":3,"objective":"进入1-1，在剧情问号处击退拦路兽群","requires_all":["S00-03"],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["narrator","松根石阶尽头，一位山客气喘吁吁地跑来，怀里空得很有说服力。"],["mountain_man","少侠，前头石滩有两位不识字的书友，把我的手稿围住了！"],["hero","书友？"],["mountain_man","一只公鸡，一只黄鼠狼。它们看书不用眼，用嘴。"],["you_bai","本座听着，像是你的著作终于有了读者。"],["mountain_man","手稿背面包过芝麻饼！那是半辈子的路，不是半辈子的饼！"],["hero","你留在安全处指路。我去把手稿取回来，读者也劝退。"],["you_bai","先备好家伙再动身。江湖第一课，别让祖传地图输给蘸油手稿。"]],"options":[],"hints":["这一段得实际进图，先护住山客和手稿。","到1-1剧情问号，用当前队伍击退拦路兽群。","在必经剧情问号完成任务战斗并获胜，手稿才算保住。"],"result":"拦路兽群被击退，山客与手稿平安，获知国清寺仍存旧路记录。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":10,"normal_boxes":10,"box_level":5},"art":{"node_id":"S00-04","file":"s00_04_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["mountain_man","hero","you_bai"],"scene":"A decisive comic action keyframe during the manuscript rescue. The hero sweeps his bamboo staff across the frame to catch and lift three intact manuscript sheets away from the beast's reach, his torso twisting dynamically but his footing secure. The elderly mountain traveler on the other side opens a cloth bag wide to catch the rescued papers, his hat tilted by the rush. Youbai makes a bright bodiless blue-purple diversion from the opposite height. The paper wrapping reveals one simple sesame flatbread, making the animals' interest understandable. Keep the human relay and crossing diagonals as the focus; no gratitude lineup, no seated map reading, no gore. Necessary beast designs must match the stage's real roster if visible.","mood":"Urgent slapstick with real care for the mountain traveler's irreplaceable notes.","key_moment":"护的不是奇书秘宝，而是包过饼的半生手稿：挑纸、接稿、引兽三人同时动起来。","camera":"wide decisive action with crossing diagonals","facts":["进入1-1，在剧情问号处击退拦路兽群","拦路兽群被击退，山客与手稿平安，获知国清寺仍存旧路记录。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S00_04.T_Story_S00_04"},"after_battle_lines":[["narrator","兽群终于退开。你用竹竿挑起散页，山客张开布袋接住，饼屑比掌声落得还响。"],["mountain_man","稿在，人也在。那两块饼就当稿费了。"],["hero","下回另找张油纸，别让读者吃到路线结局。"],["you_bai","本座负责照路，不负责给芝麻提亮。"],["mountain_man","国清寺还存着旧路记录。你们带图去对照，比听我这张饿嘴靠谱。"],["hero","好。先补图，再补午饭。"]],"enemy_ids":["Enemy.Ch1.Rooster","Enemy.Ch1.Weasel"]},{"id":"S00-05","title":"国清寺","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"你带着断桥的疑问见住持。幽白想请一份‘绝不会错’的正本，住持却展开一张补丁摞补丁的旧图。","script_revision":2,"objective":"请住持核对旧桥与山路记载","requires_all":["S00-04"],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":true,"lines":[["you_bai","请住持取正本来。抄本会错，正本总该稳当。"],["narrator","住持展开旧图，一层纸翻开，底下还有一层。桥的旧画、新画和绕行线，叠得像件百家衣。"],["hero","这正本，缝得挺勤。"],["abbot","桥毁过，溪涨过，路也改过。每来一个亲眼走过的人，便添一处。"],["you_bai","那……哪层才算祖宗定下的？"],["abbot","祖宗走过的那层。你今日走过的，也可以算一层。"],["narrator","幽白让开卷角，露出自己刚才死挡着的歪批注。住持确认旧桥已毁，松根石阶正是如今通行的路。"],["hero","明白了。敬重前人，不耽误把眼前这一笔画对。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意请住持核对旧桥与山路记载。","这一步要做的是：请住持核对旧桥与山路记载。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：住持确认旧桥已毁、新路已成，允许以实地证据补注抄图。"],"result":"住持确认旧桥已毁、新路已成，允许以实地证据补注抄图。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":5},"art":{"node_id":"S00-05","file":"s00_05_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["you_bai","hero","abbot"],"scene":"An overhead-leaning close view of the reveal: the abbot lifts two broad hinged paper correction patches from an old courtyard map, exposing a crossed-out bridge and a clear hillside stair detour underneath. Across the table the hero leans forward with delighted realization, while Youbai physically yields the corner it was trying to obscure and looks caught out. Hands lift and hold the layered paper at different heights; all three faces are visible. Three large paper layers at most, no readable writing or second intact bridge, no polite document presentation pose.","mood":"A warm revelation that overturns authority without mocking the people who preserved the records.","key_moment":"所谓正本没有神谕，只有一层层被认真改过的补丁。","camera":"high close reveal of lifted map layers","facts":["请住持核对旧桥与山路记载","住持确认旧桥已毁、新路已成，允许以实地证据补注抄图。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S00_05.T_Story_S00_05"}},{"id":"S00-06","title":"获得天台山简图","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"落笔前，幽白还想争一行署名。可它看见你认真划掉错路，忽然先替你照亮了那个空角。","script_revision":2,"objective":"完成天台山路段的第一笔订正","requires_all":["S00-05"],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":true,"lines":[["hero","旧桥作废，石阶补上。这里留个空角，记谁见过、何时改过。"],["you_bai","空角先写本座指导有方。"],["hero","行。后面再添：一度坚持从断桥起飞。"],["narrator","幽白憋了半晌，把光挪到了你落笔的地方。那一条歪批注，在新路旁边变得不那么刺眼了。"],["you_bai","错路也留个记号。后来人一看，便不必再踩一回。"],["abbot","这句，才像个守图的。"],["narrator","你们补成天台简图。住持另取一页黄山暗溪记录：同一段水路，竟留下两种画法。"],["hero","前辈，下回争署名之前，咱俩先把两种里哪种不对找出来。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意完成天台山路段的第一笔订正。","这一步要做的是：完成天台山路段的第一笔订正。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：天台山简图已补全，取得黄山暗溪的后续线索。"],"result":"天台山简图已补全，取得黄山暗溪的后续线索。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":5},"art":{"node_id":"S00-06","file":"s00_06_v1.png","dis)MAINSTORY"),
TEXT(R"MAINSTORY(play_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["hero","you_bai","abbot"],"scene":"An intimate turning-point composition at the table edge. The hero's brush draws one confident correction line as the small bodiless Youbai deliberately moves its light away from its own grand corner and onto the hero's hand. The abbot's broad palm steadies the opposite paper edge. Hero and spirit exchange a brief unexpectedly sincere glance in the middle of their joke. A completed simple bridge-to-stair correction remains legible as pictorial marks; a folded next clue rests aside. Focus on the choice to help, not holding a finished map up for the viewer.","mood":"Quiet payoff after the chase and fight; affectionate, lightly comic sincerity.","key_moment":"幽白第一次主动照着主角改错，争功的火变成了帮忙的光。","camera":"intimate oblique close-up around the brush and three eyelines","facts":["完成天台山路段的第一笔订正","天台山简图已补全，取得黄山暗溪的后续线索。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S00_06.T_Story_S00_06"}},{"id":"S00-07","title":"客栈","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"掌柜把旧桥改道说得云山雾罩，还想卖你一份保真路图。你一低头，发现证据就垫在他屁股底下。","script_revision":2,"objective":"向掌柜核实山路与住店传闻","requires_all":["S00-02"],"requires_any":[],"optional":true,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["innkeeper","本店可添茶，也可问路。问路另有问路的价，保真另算。"],["hero","那你先把刚才两种相反的走法保成一种。"],["you_bai","本座赞成。收费可以分档，山路不该分身。"],["narrator","掌柜一挪凳子，凳脚露出半截旧桥栏杆，断口还留着熟悉的木榫。"],["hero","原来桥没退休，转来你家坐班了。"],["innkeeper","旧桥拆料做的！香客改走石阶之后，我这儿生意也跟着挪了门。"],["narrator","你让他指出改道的位置，又把桥料与沿途所见对上。掌柜把准备收钱的手改成了添茶。"],["innkeeper","这壶算我请。往后传闻多听，落笔前多看一眼——别学我，嘴比门路多。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意向掌柜核实山路与住店传闻。","这一步要做的是：向掌柜核实山路与住店传闻。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：从掌柜处核实改道传闻，学会把传闻和实地证据分开记。"],"result":"从掌柜处核实改道传闻，学会把传闻和实地证据分开记。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":5},"art":{"node_id":"S00-07","file":"s00_07_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["innkeeper","hero","you_bai"],"scene":"A low counter-height visual punchline in the mountain inn. The innkeeper tips his stool sideways, unexpectedly exposing a single large reused broken-bridge railing beneath it. The hero bends from the waist to inspect the unmistakable wooden joint and looks up with a dry grin; Youbai drifts under the raised stool and stares back at the embarrassed proprietor. The innkeeper's other hand offers the teapot instead of asking for payment. Strong foreground prop reveal, three distinct levels and connected gazes, no labels or jar writing.","mood":"Lighthearted Chinese wuxia comedy, relaxed relief after a small success.","key_moment":"保真问路生意露了底：掌柜坐着的凳子，正是旧桥拆下来的料。","camera":"low foreground prop reveal under a lifted stool","facts":["向掌柜核实山路与住店传闻","从掌柜处核实改道传闻，学会把传闻和实地证据分开记。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S00_07.T_Story_S00_07"}}]},{"id":"S01","title":"黄山·仙路也是人走的","summary":"亮光会骗人，高人也会嘴硬。循着求救声找到的人，先露了怯，再用亲见的痕迹证明：一条好路，需要几种证据作伴。","stage_number":2,"mainline_end":"S01-05","nodes":[{"id":"S01-01","title":"云雾缭绕的黄山脚下","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"雾中传来‘仙人指路’的喊声，幽白立刻要去会同行。樵夫一把拦住：那是它自己的回声。","script_revision":2,"objective":"确认入山方向与暗溪疑点","requires_all":[],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["narrator","黄山脚下，天台住持给的抄页画了两个暗溪出口。远处雾里，忽然有人拖长声音喊：这——边——"],["you_bai","山中果有同道！本座去问个明白。"],["hero","你先别急着拓展人脉。那声儿怎么这么像你？"],["woodcutter","就是它方才喊的。回声绕过山肩，慢半拍才回来。"],["narrator","幽白漂出去半丈，又听见自己那声‘本座’。它退回来，把火焰缩小了一圈。"],["you_bai","本座主要是检验此山的传音条件。"],["woodcutter","检验完就歇脚。想查暗溪，先把眼前的路认清。"],["hero","走吧，前辈。你这位同道，暂时只会复述。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意确认入山方向与暗溪疑点。","这一步要做的是：确认入山方向与暗溪疑点。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：找到樵夫，确认应先核对山路和暗溪线索。"],"result":"找到樵夫，确认应先核对山路和暗溪线索。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":10},"art":{"node_id":"S01-01","file":"s01_01_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["you_bai","hero","woodcutter"],"scene":"A clear comic false revelation in a misty Huangshan entrance. Youbai surges confidently into a broad white gap between two large mountain silhouettes, then twists its bodiless flame back in offended surprise at its own echo. The woodcutter catches the hero's pack strap to halt him safely; the hero turns toward the spirit with a knowing eyebrow. Their motions oppose one another across a single open fog corridor. No second spirit, no text bubbles, no tiny mist speckles.","mood":"Lighthearted Chinese wuxia comedy, relaxed relief after a small success.","key_moment":"幽白冲出去会‘仙人’，却被自己的回声招回来。","camera":"wide mist corridor with opposed movement","facts":["确认入山方向与暗溪疑点","找到樵夫，确认应先核对山路和暗溪线索。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S01_01.T_Story_S01_01"}},{"id":"S01-02","title":"山下歇脚","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"幽白越卖力照路，眼前越白。樵夫把自己的头巾一搭，仙家光辉终于变成了能照见脚下的灯。","script_revision":2,"objective":"向樵夫询问可靠的辨路方法","requires_all":["S01-01"],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["you_bai","雾浓无妨，本座再亮一些。"],["narrator","蓝光一盛，三人面前更白了。主角抬脚，差点把樵夫的柴垛当成山门。"],["hero","看不见的东西倒是亮得很清楚！"],["woodcutter","收点光，只照近处。路在脚下，不在排场里。"],["narrator","樵夫把旧头巾搭在竹竿上遮住刺眼的散光，石缝、脚印和旧阶同时显了出来。"],["you_bai","这是……给本座搭了个棚？"],["woodcutter","棚有棚的用。听左边溪声，看松根旧阶，再认新脚印，三样对上才走。"],["hero","前辈，委屈一会儿。你现在比刚才好用多了。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意向樵夫询问可靠的辨路方法。","这一步要做的是：向樵夫询问可靠的辨路方法。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：得到脚印、旧石阶和溪声三条辨路线索。"],"result":"得到脚印、旧石阶和溪声三条辨路线索。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":10},"art":{"node_id":"S01-02","file":"s01_02_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["woodcutter","hero","you_bai"],"scene":"A low close viewpoint beneath a broad cloth shade held on the woodcutter's bamboo stick. The hero bends to peer under it as Youbai reluctantly reduces its glow; the three concrete clues, a stone stair edge, one fresh footprint and a nearby creek line, become clear below. Woodcutter's steady hand and hero's curious tilt contrast with the spirit's indignant small face. One large cloth shape creates the composition, not a seated pebble lecture.","mood":"Lighthearted Chinese wuxia comedy, relaxed relief after a small success.","key_moment":"满场刺眼的光一收，头巾下面反而照出了真路。","camera":"low close view beneath an improvised shade","facts":["向樵夫询问可靠的辨路方法","得到脚印、旧石阶和溪声三条辨路线索。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S01_02.T_Story_S01_02"}},{"id":"S01-03","title":"松影辨路","kind":"Investigation","summary":"看起来最像仙路的亮雾，没有一个人走过的痕迹。真正的旧阶又湿又土，却把你带到了一个真实的求救声前。","script_revision":2,"objective":"结合石阶、脚印与溪声选路","requires_all":["S01-02"],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["narrator","三条岔路摆在面前。中间的雾最亮，右边的碎石最省路，左边石阶却露着泥脚印。"],["you_bai","若只论气象，中路确实出众。"],["hero","咱们找的是路，不是选山景封面。"],["narrator","你用竹竿轻点右坡，一块松石滚了下去。左侧溪声贴近坡脚，新脚印沿旧阶向前，没有折返。"],["you_bai","三样都在左边。这次本座先说证据。"],["hero","这就好。等走到了，再说仙家气象。"],["narrator","你们循左阶穿过雾带，前方的呼声忽然清楚起来：救我！顺便救我的饼！"],["hero","听着挺真实，仙人一般不提这个要求。"]],"options":[{"text":"沿有脚印、旧石阶和近处溪声的左路走","correct":true,"feedback":"三条线索对上了。你们穿过雾带，前方传来求助声。"},{"text":"跟着中间最亮的雾走","correct":false,"feedback":"亮不等于路，幽白已经用沉默表达了补充意见。"},{"text":"从右边碎石坡抄近道","correct":false,"feedback":"石头先滚下去替你探了路，结果并不值得跟进。"}],"hints":["把樵夫说过的三样线索放在一起看。","只有左路同时有旧石阶、新脚印和贴近坡脚的溪声。","选择‘沿有脚印、旧石阶和近处溪声的左路走’。"],"result":"循左侧旧石阶穿过迷雾，听见猎人在前方求助。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":10},"art":{"node_id":"S01-03","file":"s01_03_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["you_bai","hero","hunter"],"scene":"The hero has just pushed aside a broad hanging pine bough while stepping onto the clearly used left stone stair. The opening in the fog reveals a distant raised food pouch near a safely seated hunter, with no danger of falling. Youbai follows the muddy footprints instead of the bright empty mist. Use the hero's turning head and the suddenly revealed human problem to make this a discovery moment; no map-reading pose, no written call.","mood":"Lighthearted Chinese wuxia comedy, relaxed relief after a small success.","key_moment")MAINSTORY"),
TEXT(R"MAINSTORY(:"仙路的幻象让位于泥脚印，雾后求救声突然变成‘顺便救饼’。","camera":"diagonal reveal through a parted fog bank","facts":["结合石阶、脚印与溪声选路","循左侧旧石阶穿过迷雾，听见猎人在前方求助。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S01_03.T_Story_S01_03"}},{"id":"S01-04","title":"黄山地形草图","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"猎人拿出亲记的暗溪图，幽白差点把纸上一个被咬穿的洞认成第二个水口。专家救回来了，图还得验。","script_revision":2,"objective":"把已核实的山路和暗溪入口记入草图","requires_all":["S01-07"],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":true,"lines":[["hunter","暗溪在石壁后绕了一道。喏，这是我亲手记的，不靠仙人传话。"],["narrator","他展开手记，一枚圆洞正好落在山形旁。幽白凑近，眼睛亮了。"],["you_bai","第二出口！两份旧图果然各有所据。"],["hunter","那是方才被啃的。"],["hero","前辈，山还没穿，纸先穿了。"],["narrator","猎人翻到背面，沿途水声、湿痕与旧阶的记录还在。你们把确实见过的入口先标下，出口暂留空。"],["hunter","下坡周先生常看草木，溪边柳先生知道旧称。别只听我一个人的。"],["hero","这句话值钱。会指路的人，也肯告诉你哪段还没把握。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意把已核实的山路和暗溪入口记入草图。","这一步要做的是：把已核实的山路和暗溪入口记入草图。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：完成黄山山路草图，标出暗溪入口与待核实的下坡水路。"],"result":"完成黄山山路草图，标出暗溪入口与待核实的下坡水路。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":10},"art":{"node_id":"S01-04","file":"s01_04_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["hunter","hero","you_bai"],"scene":"The hunter holds his saved notebook close to the foreground. One large clean bite hole beside the pictorial mountain is punctured by his own fingertip from behind, revealing it is only damaged paper. Youbai leans nose-close in embarrassed surprise; the hero laughs from a different depth while holding his brush above an unfinished sketch. Preserve the hunter's safe bandaged ankle as a small identifying detail. The real creek entrance is a simple distant dark shape, no extra branch river.","mood":"Lighthearted Chinese wuxia comedy, relaxed relief after a small success.","key_moment":"幽白把咬穿的纸洞当成山洞，猎人从背面探来一根指头拆穿。","camera":"tight foreground notebook hole with three reacting faces","facts":["把已核实的山路和暗溪入口记入草图","完成黄山山路草图，标出暗溪入口与待核实的下坡水路。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S01_04.T_Story_S01_04"}},{"id":"S01-05","title":"标注溪流","kind":"Investigation","summary":"浮叶先绕回来，幽白刚要宣布水会倒流，真正的出水口就把叶子送了出来。猜想得等证据走完。","script_revision":2,"objective":"根据水流和地势补全暗溪走向","requires_all":["S01-04"],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":true,"lines":[["narrator","你把三片大叶放进上游。叶子先在回水处绕了一圈，竟又朝你们漂来。"],["you_bai","看！此水逆行，旧图或许另有玄机——"],["hero","先等它把这一圈走完。"],["narrator","水势带着叶子转向左下，片刻后，三片叶从同侧低出口一一漂出。右边高槽仍干着，旧苔纹丝不动。"],["hunter","原来前头那段是回水，不是另一条河。"],["you_bai","本座刚才那个‘或许’，用得很严谨。"],["hero","幸亏你留了俩字，不然又得留一座桥那么大的面子。"],["narrator","浮叶、水痕、高低地势对上了。你落下连接暗溪的那一笔，这次谁也没有抢在水前头说完。"]],"options":[{"text":"把暗溪连到左下方较低的出水口","correct":true,"feedback":"浮叶与高低地势相互印证，水路线补全。"},{"text":"连到右侧较高的干槽","correct":false,"feedback":"水也想上进，但它没有报名爬坡。再看看出口的高低和湿痕。"},{"text":"两边都画上，显得内容丰富","correct":false,"feedback":"图不是菜单，不能看着顺眼就全点。只记证据支持的水路。"}],"hints":["先看浮叶真正从哪里出来。","左下方出口更低而且有水；右槽干燥，苔痕也旧。","选择‘把暗溪连到左下方较低的出水口’。"],"result":"暗溪按左下方低处出口补全，黄山草图完成。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":10},"art":{"node_id":"S01-05","file":"s01_05_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["hero","you_bai","hunter"],"scene":"At water level, three broad leaves round one clean sweeping current and emerge from the lower-left outlet. Above, the hero crouches on a secure rock with a deliberately raised wait-a-moment palm toward Youbai, while the hunter leans over from behind and suddenly recognizes the outlet. The spirit's mouth remains half-open mid-explanation. The dry high groove is clearly separate. One large S-shaped flow organizes the action; no granular foam or polite sketch presentation.","mood":"Lighthearted Chinese wuxia comedy, relaxed relief after a small success.","key_moment":"叶子绕一圈才现真出口，幽白的长篇解释卡在半句。","camera":"water-level reveal with a large curved current","facts":["根据水流和地势补全暗溪走向","暗溪按左下方低处出口补全，黄山草图完成。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S01_05.T_Story_S01_05"}},{"id":"S01-06","title":"大雾封山","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"樵夫说雾大时要等，幽白却忽然念出一个早没人用了的地名。它这回真记住了东西，只是忘了先问今日叫什么。","script_revision":2,"objective":"了解雾天的安全通行经验","requires_all":["S01-02"],"requires_any":[],"optional":true,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["woodcutter","雾合起来就等，别往不认得的险坡钻。山不赶人，人常自己赶自己。"],["you_bai","此处旧称回声坳，风从西面转，声从东面到。"],["woodcutter","回声坳？老人倒讲过，如今大家叫歇脚湾。"],["hero","怪不得刚才越喊越乱。前辈这次记的，真有用。"],["narrator","幽白精神一振，险些又把光放大。你轻轻把遮光头巾往回提了提。"],["you_bai","本座知道，照脚下。夸两句也不会忘。"],["woodcutter","旧名字留着，今日怎么走也记着。两样合一处，才省后来人的腿。"],["hero","都记。一个认得从前，一个熟悉今天，这路就稳了。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意了解雾天的安全通行经验。","这一步要做的是：了解雾天的安全通行经验。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：记下雾天辨路经验，得到对山路传闻的补充说明。"],"result":"记下雾天辨路经验，得到对山路传闻的补充说明。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":10},"art":{"node_id":"S01-06","file":"s01_06_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["woodcutter","you_bai","hero"],"scene":"Under a broad safe rock shelter, the woodcutter and hero exchange a look of recognition as the spirit finally contributes useful old knowledge. Youbai rises proudly; the hero gently lowers the plain shading cloth a little without looking away from the woodcutter. Their subtle gesture and acknowledgment are the focus, with large empty fog outside. A quiet relational payoff, no random magic or warning sign text.","mood":"Lighthearted Chinese wuxia comedy, relaxed relief after a small success.","key_moment":"两个时代的地名对上，幽白刚想炫耀又被轻轻压回一盏实用的小灯。","camera":"quiet wide pause with an expressive cloth gesture","facts":["了解雾天的安全通行经验","记下雾天辨路经验，得到对山路传闻的补充说明。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S01_06.T_Story_S01_06"}},{"id":"S01-07","title":"解救猎人","kind":"JourneyBattle","summary":"猎人吹口哨求援，先到的却是闻饼香的山兽。他想保住行家的体面，你得先保住这个行家。","script_revision":3,"objective":"进入1-2，在剧情问号处击退兽群并救下猎人","requires_all":["S01-03"],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["narrator","松林深处响起短哨，接着是一声比哨还急的喊。"],["hunter","这边！脚扭了！我的午饭把半座山的胃都叫来了！"],["hero","你求援还发用餐请柬？"],["hunter","黄鼠狼、公鸡、狸猫，已经凑齐一桌。就差我当桌！"],["you_bai","你先靠稳石头，别举着干粮和它们比谁站得高。"],["hunter","手记也滑到水边了。人、笔记，能救就救；饼排最后！"],["hero","次序总算对了。待在原地，我们从稳当的山径过去。"],["you_bai","先整备再进山。救人之前，别添一位需要救的。"]],"options":[],"hints":["猎人的求助需要实际进入关卡处理。","到1-2的剧情问号处击退敌人，救援结果才会成立。","从本节点进入1-2，在剧情问号触发战斗并获胜。"],"result":"兽群被击退，猎人与手记获救，取得暗溪入口的可靠线索。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":10,"normal_boxes":10,"box_level":10},"art":{"node_id":"S01-07","file":"s01_07_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["hunter","hero","you_bai"],"scene":"Freeze the rescue's turning point: the hero sweeps his bamboo pole sideways to hook the notebook cord safely away from wet ground while holding the approach against the food-seeking animals. The injured hunter, securely seated on rock, keeps the food pouch high with one arm but finally extends his other hand to accept help. Youbai flares from the opposite side as a bodiless diversion. Actual encounter animals, if shown, are a weasel, rooster and civet. No dangling person, no gore, no already-finished thank-you tableau.","mood":"Lighthearted Chinese wuxia comedy, relaxed relief after a small success.","key_moment":"猎人举饼保命，主角横竿抢回手记；嘴硬的行家终于肯伸手求助。","camera":"low diagonal rescue with a raised food pouch","facts":["进入1-2，在剧情问号处击退兽群并救下猎人","兽群被击退，猎人与手记获救，取得暗溪入口的可靠线索。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S01_07.T_Story_S01_07"},"after_battle_lines":[["narrator","山兽退回松影。你横竿护住湿处，挑回手记，扶猎人挪到干燥的石边。"],["hunter","我这条命和这本记，今天都算你捞回来的。"],["hero","饼呢？"],["hunter","不提饼。人与饼，得有一个肯先长记性。"],["you_bai","很好，行家终于从嘴硬练成了脚稳。"],["hunter","我认得暗溪入口。等喘匀气，能肯定的、不能肯定的，都给你说清。"]],"enemy_ids":["Enemy.Ch1.Weasel","Enemy.Ch1.Rooster","Enemy.Ch1.Civet"]},{"id":"S01-08","title":"技能采卖","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"你等着听绝世武功，猎人先把自己的肉干塞远了些。第一式保命绝学：别把敌人最想要的东西挂在自己脖子上。","script_revision":2,"objective":"向猎人学习观察敌人与整备的经验","requires_all":["S01-07"],"requires_any":[],"optional":true,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["hunter","报恩归报恩，我有一门山里真能保命的本事。"],["hero","说来听听。别再是吹口哨。"],["narrator","猎人把干粮从胸前解下来，放到身后的石上，再把你的视线引向兽足印和下风处。"],["hu)MAINSTORY"),
TEXT(R"MAINSTORY(nter","先看它盯什么，准备往哪边动。你手里有什么，也得留后手。"],["you_bai","如此朴素，也配称绝学？"],["hunter","刚才朴素没做好，才劳烦你们施展不朴素的。"],["hero","这学费我已经替你打过了，今日就不交第二遍。"],["hunter","不收。你活着用得上，比听完说一句好听更算报答。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意向猎人学习观察敌人与整备的经验。","这一步要做的是：向猎人学习观察敌人与整备的经验。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：听完猎人的防身与整备经验，不额外购买或消耗物品。"],"result":"听完猎人的防身与整备经验，不额外购买或消耗物品。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":10},"art":{"node_id":"S01-08","file":"s01_08_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["hunter","hero","you_bai"],"scene":"The hunter solemnly demonstrates his great survival lesson by untying a food pouch from his chest and putting it far behind him. The hero, who had leaned forward expecting a grand martial secret, stops halfway with a dry delighted grin. Youbai hovers above the now-empty cord, visibly reconsidering. One clear prop action, asymmetric bodies and an exchanged look, no combat, purchase or gift of new equipment.","mood":"Lighthearted Chinese wuxia comedy, relaxed relief after a small success.","key_moment":"大侠等秘籍，猎人却先把肉干从脖子上摘了下来。","camera":"comic medium close prop demonstration","facts":["向猎人学习观察敌人与整备的经验","听完猎人的防身与整备经验，不额外购买或消耗物品。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S01_08.T_Story_S01_08"}},{"id":"S01-09","title":"傍溪住民·周光祖","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"周光祖还在讲草木气数，肩上的狐狸已经跳下去喝水。真正的新水痕，先被一张嘴找到了。","script_revision":2,"objective":"请周光祖辨认水边草木与新旧水痕","requires_all":["S01-04"],"requires_any":[],"optional":true,"inside_journey":true,"lines":[["zhou_guang_zu","草木有脉，水路有势。此处该先辨新旧，再论来去。"],["narrator","他话音未落，肩上的狐狸沿衣袖蹿下，踩倒一小簇湿草，径直去喝低处的水。"],["hero","您这位助手，已经交卷了。"],["zhou_guang_zu","它只是不爱写过程。"],["you_bai","低处草根湿，新草顺水压倒；高处旧槽却干。"],["zhou_guang_zu","正是。狐鼻找到水，不等于你可不看证据。"],["narrator","狐狸喝够又往大帽沿上一钻，周光祖扶着帽子，把刚才的高人姿态扶正了半寸。"],["hero","明白。您讲道理，它负责让道理显形。两位都记上。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意请周光祖辨认水边草木与新旧水痕。","这一步要做的是：请周光祖辨认水边草木与新旧水痕。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：从周光祖处取得新旧水痕的旁证，完善草木观察记录。"],"result":"从周光祖处取得新旧水痕的旁证，完善草木观察记录。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":10},"art":{"node_id":"S01-09","file":"s01_09_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["zhou_guang_zu","hero","you_bai"],"scene":"The orange fox springs down from Zhou Guangzu's shoulder along the diagonal of his sleeve toward a clearly wet low bank. Zhou catches the edge of his huge straw hat as its weight shifts; the hero reaches reflexively toward the fox, then notices the fresh bent grass. Youbai follows that new evidence with a sharp look. Retain Zhou's curled moustache and black robe. Only one fox, one wet grass clump and one old dry groove; the evidence is discovered in motion.","mood":"Lighthearted Chinese wuxia comedy, relaxed relief after a small success.","key_moment":"狐狸先喝到水，主人的高论被一口真水截了胡。","camera":"low creek foreground with a descending fox diagonal","facts":["请周光祖辨认水边草木与新旧水痕","从周光祖处取得新旧水痕的旁证，完善草木观察记录。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S01_09.T_Story_S01_09"}},{"id":"S01-10","title":"傍溪住民·垂柳先生","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"旧图把一条溪抄成了两条。垂柳先生解释得很简单：上村下村都爱给河起名，河本人从没分过家。","script_revision":2,"objective":"核对暗溪出口与民间旧称","requires_all":["S01-05"],"requires_any":[],"optional":true,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["willow_scholar","上村叫暗水，下村叫柳湾。抄图的人各问了一边，便认真画成了两条。"],["hero","河路没分家，户口先分了两本。"],["you_bai","一名或有一源，古人也未必全无深意。"],["narrator","垂柳先生弯下一根长柳枝，从图上的两处旧称位置轻轻划过，最后指回脚边同一股水。"],["willow_scholar","深意可以多想，水从哪里流到哪里，先看明白。"],["hero","别称留旁注，水路合起来。黄山这笔终于不是谁嗓门大谁赢。"],["you_bai","本座今日也提供了有效证据。"],["willow_scholar","记上。再替下一个走到湘江的人留一句：河有许多叫法，人也有许多说法。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意核对暗溪出口与民间旧称。","这一步要做的是：核对暗溪出口与民间旧称。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：确认暗溪与柳湾是同一段水路的地方称呼，补上旁注。"],"result":"确认暗溪与柳湾是同一段水路的地方称呼，补上旁注。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":10},"art":{"node_id":"S01-10","file":"s01_10_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["willow_scholar","hero","you_bai"],"scene":"The willow scholar pulls one long flexible willow branch into a large clean arc linking two pictorial positions on the spread map and the real creek beside them. The hero is halfway through erasing the duplicate river line and glances up in realization; Youbai shifts aside to let him finish. Three figures at distinct heights around one bold visual arc. No legible names and no presentation of a second river.","mood":"Lighthearted Chinese wuxia comedy, relaxed relief after a small success.","key_moment":"一根柳枝划过两处叫法，落回同一股真水，整章的争论终于合流。","camera":"broad side-on reveal organized by one willow arc","facts":["核对暗溪出口与民间旧称","确认暗溪与柳湾是同一段水路的地方称呼，补上旁注。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S01_10.T_Story_S01_10"}}]},{"id":"S02","title":"湘江潇水·这张图管不管饭","summary":"船夫的生意经里藏着村里的难处。一条画错的水道，纸上只差一笔，田里却差一季饭。","stage_number":3,"mainline_end":"S02-06","nodes":[{"id":"S02-01","title":"湘江渡口","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"幽白刚夸完图上水路四通八达，船夫便把船停在一段干渠旁：请它先把这条‘通’解释一下。","script_revision":2,"objective":"询问前往江湾村的水陆路线","requires_all":[],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["boatman","过江上船！去江湾村，水路陆路都能走，别跟着漂亮图走。"],["you_bai","什么叫漂亮图？此图水路四通——"],["narrator","船夫把竹篙往岸边一戳。图上那条宽阔支流，此刻只扬起一小股灰。"],["hero","八达先缓缓。前辈，它这儿通的是风。"],["boatman","正河水哗哗响，村里田渠却干着。抄图的人只管画蓝线，庄稼可不吃墨。"],["you_bai","也许是时令……"],["hero","那就问现在住这儿的人。江湾村怎么去？"],["boatman","坐船到村边，走路沿旧堤。先讲条件，再开船。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意询问前往江湾村的水陆路线。","这一步要做的是：询问前往江湾村的水陆路线。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：确认江湾村有水陆两种走法，并听闻水道异常。"],"result":"确认江湾村有水陆两种走法，并听闻水道异常。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":15},"art":{"node_id":"S02-01","file":"s02_01_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["boatman","hero","you_bai"],"scene":"One decisive comic image at a ferry landing: the sturdy boatman drives the blunt bottom of his bamboo pole into a visibly DRY side ditch, raising one broad small puff of dust. The hero halfway unfolds his map and swivels his whole torso toward the evidence; Youbai's boast freezes on his face. A broad blue-green MAIN river remains clearly flowing behind the dry ditch. Strong diagonal pole, only three large character shapes, no repair yet.","mood":"A sharp comic interruption grounded in a real village problem.","key_moment":"竹篙戳中干渠，漂亮舆图被现实当场反驳。","camera":"Low bank-level angle: bamboo pole and dry channel cut across the foreground, boatman towering on the left, hero twisted around with his map on the right.","facts":["询问前往江湾村的水陆路线","确认江湾村有水陆两种走法，并听闻水道异常。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S02_01.T_Story_S02_01"}},{"id":"S02-02","title":"舌战船夫","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"你准备砍船价，船夫却把伸出的手一翻，露出满掌泥痕。他想谈的条件，比一趟船钱重些。","script_revision":2,"objective":"用已知路线与村情说服船夫讲清条件","requires_all":["S02-01"],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["boatman","逆风费力，顺水费心。去江湾村，还得答应我一件事。"],["hero","先说好，我不买船，也不接手祖传码头。"],["boatman","你们真肯查图，就别只在村口看一眼。那条渠，替我们查到底。"],["narrator","船夫摊开手，指缝还嵌着昨夜清渠留下的泥。"],["you_bai","你方才伸手，不是要加钱？"],["boatman","钱挣少了还能撑两趟船。田再旱下去，这一船人的饭找谁要？"],["hero","这事我们记下。水路和陆路各有什么线索，也请你讲清。"],["boatman","水路能问老行人，陆路能看旧堤。哪路都行，别让村里再白等。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意用已知路线与村情说服船夫讲清条件。","这一步要做的是：用已知路线与村情说服船夫讲清条件。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：船夫讲清两条路线，水路与陆路分支均可体验。"],"result":"船夫讲清两条路线，水路与陆路分支均可体验。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":15},"art":{"node_id":"S02-02","file":"s02_02_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["boatman","hero","you_bai"],"scene":"At the ferry, the boatman turns one rough muddy palm upward into the space where the hero expected a money demand. His sleeves are rolled up; the hero's ready bargaining finger slowly lowers, mouth slightly open. Youbai peers down from the side, newly attentive. The palm is large but anatomically natural in the foreground, a coiled boat rope below; no coins, no handshake, no map held frontally. Warm restrained humanity.","mood":"The joke stops for a beat; respect replaces susp)MAINSTORY"),
TEXT(R"MAINSTORY(icion.","key_moment":"被误认为讨价的手，翻过来是连夜清渠的泥痕。","camera":"Intimate over-hero-shoulder framing. Boatman's open muddy palm is the large foreground focal shape, his face beyond it; hero's reaction is in profile.","facts":["用已知路线与村情说服船夫讲清条件","船夫讲清两条路线，水路与陆路分支均可体验。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S02_02.T_Story_S02_02"}},{"id":"S02-03","title":"船上施贫","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"你递出干粮，老行人却拿起两根筷子，在船板上摆出了旧渠的来龙去脉。原来这趟船上还有位没挂招牌的行家。","script_revision":2,"objective":"帮助同船老行人，听取上游水情","requires_all":["S02-02"],"requires_any":[],"optional":true,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["poor_traveler","赶路误了饭点，肚子比船橹还准时。"],["hero","我这儿有干粮。您先吃，不急着谢。"],["boatman","热水也有。老爷子年轻时修过这边的渠，问水找他就对了。"],["poor_traveler","修过几段罢了。借两根筷子，我给你们摆摆。"],["narrator","老人一手压着干粮，另一手把筷子斜接起来：一根是正河，一根是向田里落低的支渠。"],["you_bai","原来船上还藏着一位水路掌门。"],["poor_traveler","掌门也得吃饭。正河没断，是两根筷子相接这儿堵了。"],["hero","明白。这顿饭我请，这堂课我记。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意帮助同船老行人，听取上游水情。","这一步要做的是：帮助同船老行人，听取上游水情。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：老行人得到帮助，得知支渠堵塞而非整条河断流。"],"result":"老行人得到帮助，得知支渠堵塞而非整条河断流。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":15},"art":{"node_id":"S02-03","file":"s02_03_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["poor_traveler","hero","you_bai","boatman"],"scene":"Inside a stable small ferry, a dignified patched-blue-robed elderly traveler bends over two chopsticks placed in a joined branching shape on a plain boat plank. He pins his modest food parcel with an elbow while demonstrating the canal with his other hand. Hero crouches opposite, intensely following the tiny model; the boatman looks back over his shoulder without abandoning his pole, Youbai leans close. The old man actively teaches rather than receiving a ceremonial gift. One clean broad river band surrounds the boat.","mood":"Warm curiosity and the unexpected authority of lived experience.","key_moment":"受助老人用两根筷子讲清水路，双方从施舍关系变成平等交换。","camera":"Steep three-quarter overhead looking into the skiff, two chopsticks and a modest food parcel anchor the center, faces cluster at different heights around them.","facts":["帮助同船老行人，听取上游水情","老行人得到帮助，得知支渠堵塞而非整条河断流。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S02_03.T_Story_S02_03"}},{"id":"S02-04","title":"村头问询","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"村民把新沟挖得笔直漂亮，偏偏水只往回流。幽白看了一眼坡，决定先把夸奖咽回去。","script_revision":2,"objective":"通过村民与水痕了解断水位置","requires_all":["S02-02"],"requires_any":[],"optional":true,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["villager","这沟昨天刚挖，直不直？整不整齐？"],["hero","很直。可怎么一路往高处走？"],["villager","大家急，照着新抄的图就挖了。你看，倒桶水试试。"],["narrator","水刚倒下，便沿沟回流，绕到村民自己的鞋尖。"],["you_bai","这沟志向高远，只是水尚未练成轻功。"],["hero","先别加挖。旧渠入口在哪？那里原来能通水吗？"],["villager","旧堤转弯处。前些日子竹枝杂物冲下来，才开始断水。"],["hero","那就查旧入口。图错一笔，大家可要多挖好几天。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意通过村民与水痕了解断水位置。","这一步要做的是：通过村民与水痕了解断水位置。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：从陆路村头确认支渠入口与杂物淤堵的线索。"],"result":"从陆路村头确认支渠入口与杂物淤堵的线索。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":15},"art":{"node_id":"S02-04","file":"s02_04_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["villager","hero","you_bai"],"scene":"A farmer tips a SMALL bucket into a new uphill ditch; the little ribbon of water visibly runs back toward his own shoes. He hops one foot up in surprise while hero squats off to the side tracing the wrong incline with a flat palm. Youbai hangs sideways above the slope in a wry pause. Low camera makes the channel's uphill angle obvious. This is a small failed test, not a flood, not restored irrigation.","mood":"Physical comedy with a clear, readable piece of evidence.","key_moment":"测试水流原路回到挖沟人的鞋边，一眼看清‘漂亮却逆坡’的错误。","camera":"Ground-level along the ditch, broad returning water ribbon leads from the tipped bucket in the distance to a startled lifted shoe in the foreground.","facts":["通过村民与水痕了解断水位置","从陆路村头确认支渠入口与杂物淤堵的线索。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S02_04.T_Story_S02_04"}},{"id":"S02-05","title":"江湾村治水","kind":"JourneyInvestigation","summary":"顺着水声找到旧渠口，竹枝把真正的入口堵得严严实实。拔掉这团塞子，比再挖十条漂亮新沟有用。","script_revision":2,"objective":"进入1-3调查河道，判断并疏通支渠入口","requires_all":[],"requires_any":["S02-03","S02-04"],"optional":false,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["villager","人都叫齐了。你说往哪挖，我们就往哪挖！"],["hero","先把锄头放放。今天少挖几下，也算帮忙。"],["narrator","低处旧支渠口挤着竹枝、落叶和淤泥；渠外正河仍在流。新挖的高沟反而朝坡上伸去。"],["you_bai","像不像一壶茶，壶嘴塞住了，大家忙着给壶盖开窗？"],["villager","那我昨天就是开窗开得最卖力的。"],["hero","别忙着怪谁。认准正河与田渠相接的地方，再一起动手。"],["elder","我守在下游看水。等你们清开，先放小股，别把渠岸冲坏。"],["hero","好。先把路还给水。"]],"options":[{"text":"清走旧支渠入口的竹枝落叶，疏通淤泥","correct":true,"feedback":"水终于找回了正经上班路线，顺着旧支渠流进田里。"},{"text":"把新挖的高沟再往山坡上延长","correct":false,"feedback":"这条沟很有上进心，可惜水不配合。检查入口和地势。"},{"text":"把正河拦住，等它自己转弯","correct":false,"feedback":"村长连连摆手：解决一条小渠，不必给全村加个大难题。"}],"hints":["先找‘正河有水、田渠没水’之间的断点。","旧支渠入口被竹枝与淤泥堵住，旧渠地势向农田降低；新沟却逆坡。","选择‘清走旧支渠入口的竹枝落叶，疏通淤泥’。"],"result":"支渠入口被疏通，水重新流向农田；村长闻讯赶来查看，治水目标达成。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":10,"normal_boxes":10,"box_level":15},"art":{"node_id":"S02-05","file":"s02_05_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["hero","you_bai","villager","elder"],"scene":"The moment successful irrigation repair begins: hero and the farmer brace on dry banks and lift ONE compact tangled bamboo obstruction clear of the low original inlet. A controlled fresh ribbon of blue-green water curls underneath toward the fields. The village elder farther down holds up an acknowledging hand, Youbai has to bob aside from one broad harmless splash. Dynamic opposing body weights, cohesive silhouettes and one strong water curve; no scattered debris confetti, no dangerous flood, no formal success lineup.","mood":"A satisfying collective release, strenuous but joyful.","key_moment":"合力抽出堵口竹枝的一瞬，一股清水终于拐入旧渠；这是全章劳动的高潮。","camera":"Oblique wide shot tight to the action: a large diagonal bamboo tangle being lifted, hero and farmer counterbalancing, water making a bold S curve below.","facts":["进入1-3调查河道，判断并疏通支渠入口","支渠入口被疏通，水重新流向农田；村长闻讯赶来查看，治水目标达成。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S02_05.T_Story_S02_05"}},{"id":"S02-06","title":"潇水古图","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"村长没有请出什么镇村宝卷，而是解开自己的袖口：真正能用的古图，早被汗水和田泥磨软了。","script_revision":2,"objective":"结合实地水道修正潇水古图","requires_all":["S02-05"],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":true,"lines":[["elder","你们要找古图？在这儿。"],["narrator","村长解开袖口，取出一包磨软的油布。图上水线朴素，折痕却结结实实。"],["you_bai","就这么贴身揣着？不供个匣子？"],["elder","下田要用，供起来谁认沟？倒是那几张描金的抄本，越抄越不认得家了。"],["hero","湾渠、田沟……同一股水，乡里上下游叫法不同，被抄成了两条。"],["elder","对。水今天通了，这笔也该通。"],["hero","我把实地入口和两处叫法合注。往永州的旧道，也请您核一遍。"],["elder","沿下游去柳子庙，旧志和碑记还在。记不准的，到了再问。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意结合实地水道修正潇水古图。","这一步要做的是：结合实地水道修正潇水古图。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：潇水古图已核对补注，取得永州柳子庙的后续线索。"],"result":"潇水古图已核对补注，取得永州柳子庙的后续线索。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":15},"art":{"node_id":"S02-06","file":"s02_06_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["elder","hero","you_bai"],"scene":"The small village elder rolls his work sleeve back and draws a worn oilcloth map packet from its inner wrap. The soft folded paper almost slips; the hero seated on a low doorstep catches its bottom corner with one open hand. Youbai peers into the humble sleeve in surprise. A single restored water-channel shape lies beyond the doorstep. Emphasize cared-for utilitarian material and expressive hands, no gold treasure chest, no ceremonial presentation of a flat map to camera.","mood":"Affectionate discovery of value hidden in everyday use.","key_moment":"村长从贴身袖包抽出磨软的实用古图，反转‘珍贵古图必有隆重仪式’。","camera":"Close side view centered on the elder's worn sleeve and unfurling oilcloth, hero leaning in from a lower seated position, faces not symmetrically arranged.","facts":["结合实地水道修正潇水古图","潇水古图已核对补注，取得永州柳子庙的后续线索。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S02_06.T_Story_S02_06"}},{"id":"S02-07","title":"呈谢纷纷","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"村民的谢礼走了一圈，又回到参与清渠的人手里。幽白伸长脖子等夸奖，最后只分到一股葱香。","script_revisio)MAINSTORY"),
TEXT(R"MAINSTORY(n":2,"objective":"接受村民谢意，说明共同治水的功劳","requires_all":["S02-05"],"requires_any":[],"optional":true,"inside_journey":true,"lines":[["villager","自家菜，不值钱，路上添口热乎的！"],["narrator","一把青菜刚到你怀里，第二只菜篮便从另一边递来。你忙把第一把分回清渠的人。"],["hero","慢些慢些！我背的是行囊，不是移动菜市。"],["you_bai","本座全程督导，按理也该——"],["villager","那给前辈闻闻新葱？"],["you_bai","……芳香扑鼻，十分厚重。"],["hero","这水是大家一起通的。笔记里不能只写我们。"],["villager","成。记人随你，菜得带点。纸上的功劳又不能下锅。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意接受村民谢意，说明共同治水的功劳。","这一步要做的是：接受村民谢意，说明共同治水的功劳。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：与村民互致谢意，将共同疏渠的经历记入行旅笔记。"],"result":"与村民互致谢意，将共同疏渠的经历记入行旅笔记。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":15},"art":{"node_id":"S02-07","file":"s02_07_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["villager","hero","you_bai"],"scene":"A lively vegetable relay on the restored canal bank: two farmers approach from opposite edges with modest baskets, the hero in the center twists to pass a bunch of greens back to the first helper just as a second basket reaches him. His map stays safely tucked away. Youbai stretches toward a single scallion held up like an absurd award. Only four main figures, clear overlapping arms and distinct gestures, no huge food mountain and no posed gratitude ceremony.","mood":"Bustling affectionate comedy after shared hard work.","key_moment":"谢礼被主角顺手分回劳动者，形成热闹的人与菜的接力。","camera":"Playful lateral close-medium shot: hero sandwiched between two opposing baskets, torso twisting as he passes one small vegetable bunch back.","facts":["接受村民谢意，说明共同治水的功劳","与村民互致谢意，将共同疏渠的经历记入行旅笔记。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S02_07.T_Story_S02_07"}},{"id":"S02-08","title":"答谢呈图","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"你问古图是谁画的，村长掰着手指数了半天：有人会写，有人不会写，但走过的路都在里面。","script_revision":2,"objective":"听村长讲清古图的保存与流传","requires_all":["S02-06"],"requires_any":[],"optional":true,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["hero","村长，这张图的作图人叫什么？我想记清来处。"],["elder","最早那笔是我祖父。后来撑船的添水位，种田的改渠口，认字的替不认字的记。"],["you_bai","那落款岂不是比图还长？"],["elder","写不下就别只写一个大名。渠又不是某一个人挖的。"],["narrator","老人按住图角，指甲缝里的田泥和旧纸上的浅褐手印，竟有些相像。"],["hero","明白。记流传，也记每条说法是谁亲眼见的。"],["elder","错了就回来问。别把我们供成不许改的老神仙。"],["you_bai","这句话……本座记住了。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意听村长讲清古图的保存与流传。","这一步要做的是：听村长讲清古图的保存与流传。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：补记古图的来源与作图者口述，完善证据记录。"],"result":"补记古图的来源与作图者口述，完善证据记录。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":15},"art":{"node_id":"S02-08","file":"s02_08_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["elder","hero","you_bai"],"scene":"A quiet human-scale composition: the elder's weathered fingertip rests beside one faded palm smudge on the old working map, while the hero pauses his brush above a separate small notebook to listen. The elder is in cropped profile, not facing camera; Youbai lowers close to the old trace with an unusually thoughtful expression. Only simple drawn river lines, no readable writing. Warm late light, broad clean tabletop and plenty of calm space.","mood":"Reflective and intimate, a breath between larger comic scenes.","key_moment":"带泥的指尖与古图旧手印相叠，幽白意识到守图也是守住许多普通人的经验。","camera":"Quiet close-up across the tabletop: elder's weathered hand and hero's writing hand are primary; Youbai's small reflective face occupies one side, elder's profile partially visible.","facts":["听村长讲清古图的保存与流传","补记古图的来源与作图者口述，完善证据记录。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S02_08.T_Story_S02_08"}}]},{"id":"S03","title":"永州柳子庙·背得走的与留下的","summary":"金贵这次同行，有他自己的未竟心愿。一个专盯行囊的脚夫，把小算盘打成了火险，也逼众人分清什么才真正该护住。","stage_number":4,"mainline_end":"S03-07","nodes":[{"id":"S03-01","title":"江湾村头","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"离村前，村民又往行囊里塞了一把菜。你把菜叶护得像宝贝，谁料这模样很快要惹来一双贪心的眼睛。","script_revision":2,"objective":"告别江湾村，确认永州方向","requires_all":[],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["villager","去永州沿旧堤，柳子庙那条路别错过。再带把菜！"],["hero","方位我记牢了，菜也快把我记牢了。"],["narrator","村民趁你转身，把一把青菜塞进竹篓。你忙回手护住，险些和自己的背带拧成结。"],["you_bai","好身法。江湖上少见这种背对敌人的擒菜手。"],["hero","这叫不辜负乡亲。不是护什么稀世珍宝。"],["villager","菜别闷着，图别淋着。都拿稳，比一路说谢强。"],["hero","记住了。你们新通的渠，也别忘了常清入口。"],["narrator","水声还在身后，旧道已伸向永州。你的行囊比来时重，脚下却比来时有底。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意告别江湾村，确认永州方向。","这一步要做的是：告别江湾村，确认永州方向。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：与江湾村民告别，沿已确认的旧道前往永州。"],"result":"与江湾村民告别，沿已确认的旧道前往永州。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":20},"art":{"node_id":"S03-01","file":"s03_01_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["villager","hero","you_bai"],"scene":"Hero is already facing the road away from the village when a farmer tucks ONE bunch of greens into his bamboo basket. Hero reaches back awkwardly across his own strap to steady it, twisting with a comically earnest look over his shoulder. Youbai laughs from the open side. A broad restored canal behind them and one receding path ahead. No treasure, no formal farewell lineup, no overloaded mountain of gifts.","mood":"Affectionate slapstick with a small visual setup for the next conflict.","key_moment":"转身护住新塞的青菜，主角和背带拧成一团；为后面的‘贵重行李’误会埋伏笔。","camera":"Rear three-quarter medium shot; basket and reaching-back arm dominate, village farmer extends greens from the edge, route opens ahead.","facts":["告别江湾村，确认永州方向","与江湾村民告别，沿已确认的旧道前往永州。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S03_01.T_Story_S03_01"}},{"id":"S03-02","title":"前往永州","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"金贵从路旁树影里伸出烟杆，先勾住了你的菜篮，再说自己恰好顺路。可他的鞋，分明刚从反方向赶来。","script_revision":2,"objective":"与金贵重逢并约定同行","requires_all":["S03-01"],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["jin_gui","慢点走。你那把菜再晃两下，就自己去永州了。"],["narrator","一根烟杆轻轻托住松开的篮绳。草帽下，金贵还是那副没睡醒的笑。"],["hero","金贵？这么巧，你也顺路？"],["jin_gui","嗯，顺。绕了二十里来顺的。"],["you_bai","本座头回见把绕路说得这么坦荡的人。"],["jin_gui","柳子庙，我以前到门口三次，都被差事叫走。这回想进门坐一坐。"],["hero","那就同行。谁再叫你跑腿，先问问你自己愿不愿。"],["jin_gui","成。今日不赶别人的时辰。先把你这篮绳系好。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意与金贵重逢并约定同行。","这一步要做的是：与金贵重逢并约定同行。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：与金贵重逢，三人结伴前往柳子庙。"],"result":"与金贵重逢，三人结伴前往柳子庙。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":20},"art":{"node_id":"S03-02","file":"s03_02_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["jin_gui","hero","you_bai"],"scene":"On the road, Jin Gui steps out from a broad tree shadow and uses the curved end of his long bamboo pipe to support the hero's slipping basket cord. Hero is caught mid-stride, turning in startled recognition; Jin Gui's other hand raises his red-leaf straw hat a little, sleepy face breaking into a grin. Youbai hovers above the caught cord. Exact approved costumes, no smoking, no posed handshake, no fire.","mood":"An active, familiar reunion with understated warmth.","key_moment":"重逢先由烟杆托住滑落菜篮发生，随后揭出金贵是特意绕路来完成自己的心愿。","camera":"Side-on moving composition: pipe cuts in from a large tree shadow at left to catch the basket cord; hero turns mid-stride toward Jin Gui emerging lower behind.","facts":["与金贵重逢并约定同行","与金贵重逢，三人结伴前往柳子庙。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S03_02.T_Story_S03_02"}},{"id":"S03-03","title":"参天古柏密林","kind":"Investigation","summary":"热心脚夫的近道，地上有肉，草里有兽印，唯独他嘴里没有一句实话。金贵用烟杆挑起的那片肉，让笑脸一下绷住了。","script_revision":2,"objective":"观察密林近道与脚夫的异常举动","requires_all":["S03-02"],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["porter","少侠，这边近！行李沉，我替你背。"],["jin_gui","近道长肉干？你们这儿的树挺懂待客。"],["narrator","金贵用烟杆挑起路旁肉片。草下几枚兽印围着它打转，脚夫的肩袋也漏着同样的油渍。"],["porter","山客掉的！山客嘛，走哪儿掉哪儿。"],["hero","那你怎么只盯着我的图袋，不问我们往哪儿去？"],["you_bai","他不是替你找近路。他是在替行李找新主人。"],["jin_gui","稳住。别急着追问，把自己的东西拿牢。"],["hero","嗯。先认清肉干和足印，再决定怎么走。"]],"options":[{"text":"保管好行李，留意肉干与兽足印，拒绝交包","correct":true,"feedback":"近道的‘方便’是给脚夫留的。你们先保住行李，准备应对。"},{"text":"把舆图交给脚夫，自己轻装上路","correct":false,"feedback":"金贵轻轻拨回你的手：先别把主线剧情打包送人。"},{"text":"只看近道更短，立刻跟上","correct":false,"feedback":"短的是路，长的可能是后悔。再看看草丛里的东西。"}],"hints":["热心本身不是证据，看看近道上留下了什么。","肉干碎屑、绕圈兽印和脚夫盯包的举动合在一起，很不对劲。","选择‘保管好行李，留意肉干与兽足印，拒绝交包’。"],"result":"发现肉干与兽足印，识破近道有诈，准备应对密林遭遇。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_b)MAINSTORY"),
TEXT(R"MAINSTORY(oxes":0,"box_level":20},"art":{"node_id":"S03-03","file":"s03_03_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["porter","jin_gui","hero","you_bai"],"scene":"In a sparse cypress grove, Jin Gui lifts a single meat scrap with the end of his bamboo pipe. The grey-brown headcloth porter reacts by clapping a hand over the oily mouth of his shoulder bag, his salesman's smile stiffening. Hero has already drawn his own map pouch behind his hip, eyes tracking that guilty hand. Youbai peers from above the pipe. Two or three broad animal footprints on the soil support the clue; no battle, no fire, no generic group reading a map.","mood":"Comic exposure with a new edge of suspicion.","key_moment":"金贵挑起肉干，脚夫下意识捂住同样漏油的袋口，动作直接出卖他。","camera":"Tight triangular staging; lifted meat on pipe in foreground, porter's hand clamping his bag to one side, hero's suspicious profile on the other.","facts":["观察密林近道与脚夫的异常举动","发现肉干与兽足印，识破近道有诈，准备应对密林遭遇。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S03_03.T_Story_S03_03"}},{"id":"S03-04","title":"柳子庙","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"终于踏进柳子庙，金贵却没急着坐。他看见后门的影子，便把留给自己的凳子，悄悄挪到了门边。","script_revision":2,"objective":"在柳子庙核对旧志与地方图记","requires_all":["S03-10"],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":true,"lines":[["hero","找到了！旧志里这一段，正能接上潇水古图。"],["you_bai","慢翻，别把纸角当翻山的台阶。"],["jin_gui","你们看。我坐门边，透气。"],["narrator","金贵搬起凳子，却把凳脚卡在半开的后门旁。门外一道背袋影子顿了顿。"],["hero","你不是惦记这地方很久了？先过来看看。"],["jin_gui","看过一眼了。它没跑，我也不赶。倒是有人赶得很。"],["you_bai","后门？"],["jin_gui","嗯。书慢慢读，行李先放近些。别让这位熟人再替咱们‘分忧’。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意在柳子庙核对旧志与地方图记。","这一步要做的是：在柳子庙核对旧志与地方图记。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：在柳子庙找到旧志线索，并察觉堂后有异常动静。"],"result":"在柳子庙找到旧志线索，并察觉堂后有异常动静。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":20},"art":{"node_id":"S03-04","file":"s03_04_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["hero","jin_gui","you_bai"],"scene":"Inside the simple reading hall of Liuzi temple, Jin Gui quietly carries a plain stool sideways to wedge its leg near a half-open rear door. His head turns to watch a suspicious sack-shaped shadow beyond the threshold. In the foreground hero bends eagerly over an old gazetteer, with Youbai lighting a page, still unaware of that movement. Few broad beams, one table, one book. No Buddhist idol, no flames yet. Dramatic depth and contrasting attention, not three people calmly studying together.","mood":"Anticipation and quiet vigilance beneath apparent calm.","key_moment":"金贵本想安心看书，却用凳子卡住后门；人物愿望与眼前警戒形成张力。","camera":"Layered interior framing: hero absorbed over a book at the lower foreground; Jin Gui moving a stool into the rear doorway forms a separate diagonal focal plane.","facts":["在柳子庙核对旧志与地方图记","在柳子庙找到旧志线索，并察觉堂后有异常动静。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S03_04.T_Story_S03_04"}},{"id":"S03-05","title":"火险抢救","kind":"Investigation","summary":"你一眼看见了书，一把先拉住你的却是金贵。木架倒下时，‘护住旧志’终于有了先后次序。","script_revision":2,"objective":"先保人身安全，再协力护住未燃书卷","requires_all":["S03-12"],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":true,"lines":[["narrator","火舌舔上外侧草帘，你刚要伸手去够高架旧志，金贵便扯住了你的后领。"],["jin_gui","先看脚下！架子歪了！"],["hero","书还在那儿——"],["narrator","木架向空处倾倒，尘灰扑落。金贵把你拉回稳地，自己也晃了一下，你立刻反手托住他的肩。"],["you_bai","人先站稳！外沿没着的书还能搬，里面的别硬闯！"],["hero","金贵，你带人退开。我接外沿书卷，大家把水递过来。"],["jin_gui","这回听清了。人不是包袱，别想着一趟全背走。"],["hero","明白。先保人，再一起护住够得着的书。"]],"options":[{"text":"确认众人安全，协力转移外沿未燃书卷并控制火险","correct":true,"feedback":"分工终于比嘴快。人和关键书卷都保住了，火险也被控制。"},{"text":"独自钻进浓烟里，把所有东西一次搬完","correct":false,"feedback":"幽白拦住你：英雄可以慢慢当，人不能拆开重装。先守住安全范围。"},{"text":"先追脚夫理论，等争出道理再救场","correct":false,"feedback":"金贵把水桶塞过来：火不参加辩论，先让它安静。"}],"hints":["先确认人是否安全，再看哪些书卷能从安全的外沿转移。","院里有空地、帮手、水桶和湿布；合理分工比独自冲进去有效。","选择‘确认众人安全，协力转移外沿未燃书卷并控制火险’。"],"result":"众人安全，火险得到控制，关键旧志与舆图记录被护住。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":20},"art":{"node_id":"S03-05","file":"s03_05_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["hero","porter","jin_gui","you_bai"],"scene":"The critical mutual-rescue instant in a small temple reading-hall fire: Jin Gui pulls the hero's back collar away from a tilting wooden shelf; hero has turned and braces Jin Gui's shoulder with his free hand so BOTH recover stable footing. A few intact book volumes stay on an accessible foreground bench, not scattered into confetti. Youbai anxiously lights the clear exit to one side. One broad orange flame shape on a distant curtain and a single pale smoke band, no injuries, no body dangling, no triumphant after-fire pose. Dynamic believable weight and distinct intent.","mood":"Urgent mutual care, the serious emotional high point of the chapter.","key_moment":"金贵拉回抢书的主角，主角反手稳住金贵；两人互救，而非主角独自逞英雄。","camera":"Strong diagonal close-medium action, characters leaning in opposite directions but linked at shoulder and collar; falling shelf behind them angles into an empty zone.","facts":["先保人身安全，再协力护住未燃书卷","众人安全，火险得到控制，关键旧志与舆图记录被护住。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S03_05.T_Story_S03_05"}},{"id":"S03-06","title":"永州简图","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"永州简图补齐了，金贵却把行囊放下。他这次留在庙里，不是又接了谁的差事，是自己决定把这件事做完。","script_revision":2,"objective":"整理获救旧志，补齐永州简图","requires_all":["S03-05"],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":true,"lines":[["hero","永州这几处接上了。你也跟我们往西南走？"],["jin_gui","我晚些。这里缺人收拾，书还没晾干。"],["hero","又替人跑腿？"],["jin_gui","这回是我自己想留下。好不容易进了门，总不能只负责路过一场火。"],["narrator","他把行囊搁在门内，顺手接住你递来的一卷书，动作比说话郑重。"],["you_bai","那本座不催。西南寨地的碑记，我们接着查。"],["hero","等你收拾妥当，下回换你挑地方，我来顺路。"],["jin_gui","二十里以内，算你真顺。路上稳些，后领不能回回有人拎。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意整理获救旧志，补齐永州简图。","这一步要做的是：整理获救旧志，补齐永州简图。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：永州简图已补齐，与金贵暂别，留下西南寨地碑记线索。"],"result":"永州简图已补齐，与金贵暂别，留下西南寨地碑记线索。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":20},"art":{"node_id":"S03-06","file":"s03_06_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["jin_gui","hero","you_bai"],"scene":"After the fire is controlled, the temple doorway divides two chosen directions: Jin Gui inside sets his travel pouch down and accepts one saved book from the hero outside. Their hands nearly meet across the worn threshold; neither faces the viewer. Youbai hovers back, giving them room. One damp cloth and a small tidy stack of books establish cleanup, no active fire, no illness or deathbed. Warm held moment and practical affection.","mood":"Bittersweet but hopeful separation between friends with their own choices.","key_moment":"门槛两侧一递一接，金贵放下行囊主动留下，回收最初‘终于能坐一坐’的心愿。","camera":"Quiet doorway composition, Jin Gui inside with basket set down at his feet, hero outside handing a book across the threshold; profiles and hands carry the emotion.","facts":["整理获救旧志，补齐永州简图","永州简图已补齐，与金贵暂别，留下西南寨地碑记线索。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S03_06.T_Story_S03_06"}},{"id":"S03-07","title":"土司寨遗痕","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"碑记里一处眼熟的水槽刻痕，让幽白第一次主动承认：这条旧路，自己也曾记错。","script_revision":2,"objective":"比对碑形与旧志，确认前往土司寨的线索","requires_all":["S03-06"],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":true,"lines":[["hero","碑记提到西南土司寨，旧水槽旁有这道刻痕。你认识？"],["you_bai","……认识。图里把它画到了寨北。"],["hero","碑记写的是旧址。后来迁寨，水槽也搬过。"],["you_bai","那一笔，大概还是本座催着抄的。嫌人家磨蹭，没等问完。"],["narrator","幽白靠近拓下的轮廓，看了好一会儿，终于把照明移向那处待改的标记。"],["hero","知道是哪一笔，就能再查。土司首领也许还记得你。"],["you_bai","记得最好。不记得，本座便从来意重新说。羊皮图的事，也当面求证。"],["hero","这句像个靠谱的带路前辈了。走，去问活人。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意比对碑形与旧志，确认前往土司寨的线索。","这一步要做的是：比对碑形与旧志，确认前往土司寨的线索。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：确认土司寨与羊皮图的线索，永州主干完成。"],"result":"确认土司寨与羊皮图的线索，永州主干完成。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":20},"art":{"node_id":"S03-07","file":"s03_07_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["hero","you_bai"],"scene":"Near a simple old stele, the small Youbai bends close to a plain rubbing sheet pinned against a board and deliberately illuminates one mismatched trough-shaped sketch. Hero, kneeling to pack the rubbing ra)MAINSTORY"),
TEXT(R"MAINSTORY(ther than holding up a map, pauses and watches the spirit's unusually earnest face. A broad weathered stone silhouette only, no readable inscriptions, no Tusi chief appearing early, no magic transformation. A tiny gesture carries a meaningful admission.","mood":"A sincere admission after the chapter's danger, restrained hope.","key_moment":"幽白不再遮住错处，而是主动照亮自己曾催抄的错误，延续第一章的成长。","camera":"Low intimate view with tracing paper against a stone rubbing board, spirit's light catches a single mismatch while hero watches its face, not the map.","facts":["比对碑形与旧志，确认前往土司寨的线索","确认土司寨与羊皮图的线索，永州主干完成。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S03_07.T_Story_S03_07"}},{"id":"S03-08","title":"偶遇旧佣","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"金贵摊开一张折了许多次的小纸：上面没有别人的差事，只有他给自己留的几处山水。","script_revision":2,"objective":"听金贵讲重返旅途的缘由","requires_all":["S03-02"],"requires_any":[],"optional":true,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["hero","以前见你，总是东家一句话，你便跑得没影。"],["jin_gui","那时候走得多，看得少。路上每一刻，都算在别人的账里。"],["you_bai","如今自由了，可有什么雄图大志？"],["jin_gui","有。进柳子庙，坐着看完一页书。"],["narrator","他从帽内抽出一张折纸，展开又拢住。纸上只有几处粗略的山水轮廓。"],["hero","就这些？"],["jin_gui","先这些。往后想去哪，再添。可别替我一下排满。"],["hero","不排。你的路，当然由你自己挑。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意听金贵讲重返旅途的缘由。","这一步要做的是：听金贵讲重返旅途的缘由。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：了解金贵重返旅途的心愿，加深旧识情谊。"],"result":"了解金贵重返旅途的心愿，加深旧识情谊。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":20},"art":{"node_id":"S03-08","file":"s03_08_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["hero","jin_gui","you_bai"],"scene":"A quiet roadside pause: Jin Gui tips back his broad red-leaf straw hat and pulls a small carefully folded travel sketch from its inner band, smiling to himself rather than performing for others. Hero sits on a low stone below his eye level and listens; Youbai floats in the open space on the opposite side. Only a few pictorial hill shapes on the paper. Clear asymmetry, relaxed individual poses, no smoke, no gifts, no grand map display.","mood":"Small private joy and the dignity of choosing one's own journey.","key_moment":"旧佣人拿出只属于自己的小小行程，第一次不需要替谁赶时间。","camera":"Restful close profile: Jin Gui lifts his hat and slides out a small folded sketch, hero sits lower on a roadside stone, large plain sky above.","facts":["听金贵讲重返旅途的缘由","了解金贵重返旅途的心愿，加深旧识情谊。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S03_08.T_Story_S03_08"}},{"id":"S03-09","title":"假意相助","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"脚夫声称见不得你负重，直到你递给他的包裹里，露出一截萝卜。那份侠义，立刻有了挑食的毛病。","script_revision":2,"objective":"识别脚夫热心话术中的破绽","requires_all":["S03-03"],"requires_any":[],"optional":true,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["porter","少侠别多心，我就是看你背得辛苦，想帮个忙。"],["hero","那太好了。这袋最沉。"],["narrator","你把菜袋递过去。脚夫已经伸出的手，在看见萝卜头时硬生生拐了个弯。"],["porter","这个……不易碰坏。那边那只图袋更该仔细照料。"],["jin_gui","你这热心还分贵贱？"],["porter","我怕你弄丢重要东西！"],["hero","那讲讲路况。前面哪处滑，哪里绕？"],["narrator","脚夫答不上来，眼睛仍黏着图袋。你把两个包都收回自己身边。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意识别脚夫热心话术中的破绽。","这一步要做的是：识别脚夫热心话术中的破绽。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：识破脚夫回避路况、只盯贵重行李的破绽，保留警惕。"],"result":"识破脚夫回避路况、只盯贵重行李的破绽，保留警惕。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":20},"art":{"node_id":"S03-09","file":"s03_09_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["porter","jin_gui","hero","you_bai"],"scene":"Hero offers a small heavy cloth produce bag toward the porter. One unmistakable radish pokes from its mouth; the porter recoils his already-outstretched hand into an awkward fake pointing gesture toward the hero's separate secured map pouch. Jin Gui stands behind the porter with one raised eyebrow, pipe held down. Youbai watches the hand. Strong readable comic timing, no actual theft, no coin bag, no posed conversation lineup.","mood":"Dry comic exposure of a transparently selective kindness.","key_moment":"伸手接包的姿势在萝卜露头时急转弯，贪念变成可读的身体动作。","camera":"Comic close-medium side shot, protruding radish in the near foreground and porter's retracting hand form the focal pair, Jin Gui watches behind.","facts":["识别脚夫热心话术中的破绽","识破脚夫回避路况、只盯贵重行李的破绽，保留警惕。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S03_09.T_Story_S03_09"}},{"id":"S03-10","title":"密林遇劫","kind":"JourneyBattle","summary":"一头灰狼循肉味堵路，脚夫却惦记着你的图袋。前路要守，行李也要守；金贵决定把烟杆收好，先用眼睛盯人。","script_revision":3,"objective":"进入2-1，在剧情问号处击退被引来的兽群并保住行李","requires_all":["S03-03"],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["narrator","林口散着新鲜肉干，灰狼的影子在树后晃。脚夫一边催你赶路，一边盯着图袋。"],["porter","怕什么？你去探路，行李交我就是。"],["jin_gui","你那袋肉自己裂了口，倒惦记起别人完好的袋子。"],["hero","先不进。狼在前面，手在后面，这条路排得太热闹。"],["you_bai","本座数过：一头狼，外加一个需要重点观察的脚夫。"],["jin_gui","图袋我看着。你把前路清出来，别分心追人。"],["hero","好。我们一起进，谁也别擅自换位。"],["porter","诸位这防贼的架势，实在伤和气。"]],"options":[],"hints":["这一步要实际应对密林遭遇，不能只听脚夫继续解释。","进入2-1的剧情问号，沿用当前队伍击退敌人。","从本节点进入对应关卡，在剧情问号完成任务战斗并获胜。"],"result":"兽群被击退，人和舆图保住；脚夫劫掠失手后逃走。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":10,"normal_boxes":10,"box_level":20},"art":{"node_id":"S03-10","file":"s03_10_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["porter","jin_gui","hero","you_bai"],"scene":"At the decisive moment of a forest ambush, the hero stands in the FRONT RIGHT defending the party against one exact project gray wolf with a horizontal bamboo pole. Jin Gui stays CLOSE beside and just behind the hero's basket, cradling the hero's map pouch against his own chest with ONE forearm; TWO rolled map ends visibly protrude so its contents are clear. A short SLACK safety cord still connects the pouch to hero's basket. Jin Gui's other hand is raised open toward the porter in a firm stop gesture. On the LEFT the porter has reached toward the maps, but his outstretched hand remains visibly EMPTY and blocked by Jin Gui's protective position. No hand-to-hand wrestling, no ropes under tension, no transfer between enemies. Jin Gui's long bamboo pipe is safely tucked at his belt, not used as a hook or weapon. Clear alliance: hero faces beasts, Jin Gui faces thief, the two friends back each other up; porter is the outsider. Naturally planted feet, exactly two arms each, separated hands, clean readable negative spaces, one broad tree behind porter. No extra enemies in this close framing.","mood":"Brisk danger, clever teamwork and the trap turning against its maker.","key_moment":"主角横竿挡兽，金贵贴近背篓护住露出卷轴的图袋，脚夫伸手抓空；一眼看清两位同伴分工护人护图。","camera":"Clear three-quarter layered staging: thief at left reaching empty-handed, Jin Gui in middle shielding map pouch beside hero's basket, hero front-right facing exact gray wolf. Map rolls make the threatened object readable; no pipe-hook tug of war.","facts":["进入2-1，在剧情问号处击退被引来的兽群并保住行李","兽群被击退，人和舆图保住；脚夫劫掠失手后逃走。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S03_10.T_Story_S03_10","monster_references":["SourceAssets/RouteEnemies/final_selected_v1/07_graywolf.png"]},"after_battle_lines":[["narrator","灰狼退去。方才你横竿护住前路，金贵已抱稳图袋；脚夫伸手抓空，趁乱钻进了林子。"],["jin_gui","图在。烟杆也在腰里，没兼职挑担。"],["hero","人和图先点齐，不拿命追他那点胆量。"],["you_bai","点齐了。本座一团，二位两人，行李未减；和气倒是少了一个。"],["jin_gui","他跑得急，痕迹不会太干净。歇口气，再看脚下。"]],"enemy_ids":["Enemy.Ch2.GrayWolf"]},{"id":"S03-11","title":"侥幸脱逃","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"脚夫倒退着藏脚印，却忘了自己的肩袋挂在枝上。那截布带像一根箭头，比他的嘴诚实。","script_revision":2,"objective":"追查脚夫逃走留下的痕迹","requires_all":["S03-10"],"requires_any":[],"optional":true,"inside_journey":true,"lines":[["hero","人跑没了。脚印却一会儿朝这边，一会儿朝那边。"],["jin_gui","他倒着走了几步，想显得自己很会藏。"],["you_bai","此乃江湖秘术，原地增加可疑程度。"],["narrator","金贵拨开低枝，一截新扯下的布带挂在上头；断口正对着通向庙后的窄路。"],["hero","袋子都替他指路了。"],["jin_gui","新泥也带过去了。记方向，别为了追人把同行的又丢下。"],["hero","庙后可能有人靠近。我们先提醒、看好东西。"],["you_bai","把这一笔记清：他逃走了，可没说明他罢手了。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意追查脚夫逃走留下的痕迹。","这一步要做的是：追查脚夫逃走留下的痕迹。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：从布带和脚印确认脚夫逃向庙后，补充防备线索。"],"result":"从布带和脚印确认脚夫逃向庙后，补充防备线索。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":20},"art":{"node_id":"S03-11","file":"s03_11_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["jin_gui","hero","you_bai"],"scene":"After the ambush, Jin Gui lifts one low cypress branch with his pipe to )MAINSTORY"),
TEXT(R"MAINSTORY(reveal a fresh strip of the porter's grey-brown bag cloth snagged there. A short sequence of broad backwards footprints below abruptly turns toward the temple path. Hero half-crouches and looks along that revealed direction; Youbai peers underneath the hanging strip. The porter is absent, animals have gone. The visual punchline is a failed attempt to hide, not a generic footprint-reading pose.","mood":"A comic clue carrying a real warning.","key_moment":"倒退脚印试图掩饰方向，挂在低枝上的布带却指出真实逃路。","camera":"Ground-forward investigation framing: reversed footprints lead to a large dangling cloth strip, Jin Gui lifting the branch above, hero follows the revealed direction in profile.","facts":["追查脚夫逃走留下的痕迹","从布带和脚印确认脚夫逃向庙后，补充防备线索。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S03_11.T_Story_S03_11"}},{"id":"S03-12","title":"揽财纵火","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"后堂起火，脚夫借乱搂包，却搂出半袋菜。你没让他空着手——一桶救火水，正好塞过去。","script_revision":2,"objective":"识破柳庙纵火夺财的企图，组织救援","requires_all":["S03-04"],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":true,"lines":[["narrator","后堂窜起火光。脚夫缩着肩从侧边钻出，怀里紧搂一只顺手抓来的布袋。"],["porter","救东西要紧！我替你们先——"],["narrator","袋口一松，一把菜叶露了出来。他愣住的工夫，你把水桶推到他手里。"],["hero","好，救东西。先把这桶水送过去。"],["jin_gui","门边有新倒的灯油，火也是从你躲的地方起来的。还要装热心？"],["porter","我只想吓开你们，没想烧成这样……"],["you_bai","想得轻巧，着起来可不听你辩！人先退出来！"],["hero","现在提水、让路。账等人安全了，再一笔笔算。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意识破柳庙纵火夺财的企图，组织救援。","这一步要做的是：识破柳庙纵火夺财的企图，组织救援。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：识破脚夫纵火夺财的企图，众人开始有序控制火险。"],"result":"识破脚夫纵火夺财的企图，众人开始有序控制火险。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":20},"art":{"node_id":"S03-12","file":"s03_12_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["hero","porter","jin_gui","you_bai"],"scene":"At the temple rear doorway as a small fire begins deeper inside, the porter is caught clutching a stolen produce bag whose green leaves spill visibly from the opening. Hero firmly places a full wooden water bucket into the porter's now-open arms; Jin Gui behind them pulls the door clear for people to leave. Youbai looks urgently toward the exit. One broad orange fire patch in the back, no dense smoke or catastrophe yet. The porter is exposed and forced to help, not forgiven or beaten.","mood":"A sharp comic reversal under urgent real consequences.","key_moment":"偷错菜袋的脚夫被当场塞入水桶，犯罪的借口转成必须实际承担的救火动作。","camera":"Dynamic doorway medium shot; hero drives a water bucket into porter's startled arms, bag of greens sagging at his elbow, Jin Gui opens the exit behind.","facts":["识破柳庙纵火夺财的企图，组织救援","识破脚夫纵火夺财的企图，众人开始有序控制火险。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S03_12.T_Story_S03_12"}},{"id":"S03-13","title":"余善尚存","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"脚夫赔礼的话说得很快，湿书却翻得极慢。这一次，没人替他的悔意鼓掌，大家等着看他把活做完。","script_revision":2,"objective":"让脚夫承担补救，确认归还与整理记录","requires_all":["S03-05"],"requires_any":[],"optional":true,"inside_journey":true,"lines":[["porter","东西都在这儿，我没藏了。我赔不是……"],["hero","还回来是该做的。火烧坏的，也得担起来。"],["jin_gui","先别忙着保证。那页湿了，轻些揭，别扯。"],["narrator","脚夫粗手粗脚地停住，换用指腹一点点托起书角。险些裂开的纸终于完整落到晾板上。"],["porter","原来这一下，也能毁东西。"],["you_bai","你先前可毁得痛快。"],["hero","想补救，就留下慢慢做。不是说一句后悔，这事便翻篇了。"],["porter","我做。物件归谁、损了什么，都记下来，我认。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意让脚夫承担补救，确认归还与整理记录。","这一步要做的是：让脚夫承担补救，确认归还与整理记录。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：脚夫归还物品并留下整理书卷，以实际行动补救。"],"result":"脚夫归还物品并留下整理书卷，以实际行动补救。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":20},"art":{"node_id":"S03-13","file":"s03_13_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["porter","hero","jin_gui","you_bai"],"scene":"During careful cleanup after the fire is extinguished, the stocky porter bends deeply over a low drying board, using both rough fingertips to support ONE fragile damp book page without tearing it. His face is intent and ashamed, not smiling for approval. Jin Gui points to where the page needs support; hero stands beyond the table with the returned belongings gathered, Youbai silently observes. Few intact books, no flames, no instant celebratory forgiveness, no readable text.","mood":"Sober and tentative, responsibility expressed through patient work.","key_moment":"急着认错的人被迫慢下来，小心托住一页湿纸；用动作表达尚未完成的补救。","camera":"Close low tabletop shot focused on the porter's oversized rough fingers supporting a fragile damp page, Jin Gui's guiding hand nearby, hero watches from the far edge.","facts":["让脚夫承担补救，确认归还与整理记录","脚夫归还物品并留下整理书卷，以实际行动补救。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S03_13.T_Story_S03_13"}}]},{"id":"S04","title":"土司寨·信任不靠嗓门大","summary":"幽白的老面子没能直接开门，一道看反的旧刻痕才让对话继续。牛、旧渠和羊皮图牵出寨子的变迁，也让宋金宝露出花哨衣裳下肯干事的一面。","stage_number":5,"mainline_end":"S04-10","nodes":[{"id":"S04-01","title":"寨门对峙","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"幽白摆足老相识的架子，土司首领却把门杖横得更稳：曾有人拿着‘祖传宝图’，骗走了寨里的修渠钱。","script_revision":2,"objective":"向土司首领说明来意","requires_all":[],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["you_bai","老朋友，本座来了！这位少侠随我入寨——"],["narrator","木杖横过门前。首领看一眼幽白，又看一眼你的图袋，没有让开。"],["tusi","上回来的人，也说自己是老朋友。还带了张祖传宝图。"],["hero","后来呢？"],["tusi","钱跟人走了，渠替他留下来干着。你说我该先认脸，还是先问事？"],["you_bai","本座……明白了。我们来核对旧路与羊皮图，不来收钱。"],["hero","不急着开门。我们带了永州碑记的线索，请您先听听。"],["tusi","愿意把话说实，就站这儿慢慢说。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意向土司首领说明来意。","这一步要做的是：向土司首领说明来意。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：说清求证舆图的来意，土司首领愿意听取幽白的旧事。"],"result":"说清求证舆图的来意，土司首领愿意听取幽白的旧事。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":25},"art":{"node_id":"S04-01","file":"s04_01_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["tusi","hero","you_bai"],"scene":"At the simple mountain-village gate, the broad Tusi chief holds his fork-topped wooden staff horizontally across the entrance, firmly but without attacking. Youbai has floated just ahead in overconfident greeting and stops short above the barrier; hero behind raises one open calm hand and leaves his map pouch closed. Exact chief's broad angular straw hat, white curled mustache, orange cape. The staff is the bold composition line; no guards crowd, no drawn weapons, no early welcoming banquet.","mood":"Tense comic interruption with understandable caution.","key_moment":"幽白的熟人姿态被横杖截住，首领的戒备有具体旧伤而非无理刁难。","camera":"Low frontal-oblique threshold shot, chief's horizontal staff creates a strong dividing bar, hero pauses one step back while spirit floats too far forward.","facts":["向土司首领说明来意","说清求证舆图的来意，土司首领愿意听取幽白的旧事。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S04_01.T_Story_S04_01"}},{"id":"S04-02","title":"破局入寨","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"幽白描述的刻痕怎么也对不上，直到你把纸转了半圈。它当年飘在水槽上方，看见的原来一直是反的。","script_revision":2,"objective":"用可核对的旧事取得入寨许可","requires_all":["S04-01"],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["you_bai","旧水槽三道刻痕，上宽下窄，旁边还有个缺角。"],["tusi","上窄下宽。你连这都记反，还说来过？"],["hero","等一下。幽白，你当年从哪边看水槽？"],["you_bai","就在槽上飘着，低头一看……"],["narrator","你把拓样转了半圈，刻痕和缺角一齐对上。首领紧绷的眉毛终于松动。"],["hero","它的记性未必差，视角实在不太落地。"],["tusi","原来是你。旧毛病也跟着来了。进去吧，图的事还得继续核实。"],["you_bai","这回本座照路。朝向由有脚的负责。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意用可核对的旧事取得入寨许可。","这一步要做的是：用可核对的旧事取得入寨许可。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：以旧水槽与刻痕为旁证取得入寨许可。"],"result":"以旧水槽与刻痕为旁证取得入寨许可。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":25},"art":{"node_id":"S04-02","file":"s04_02_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["you_bai","tusi","hero"],"scene":"Beside the old village water trough, hero rotates a small rubbing sheet half a turn between his hands to align a simple three-notch shape with the trough's chipped rim. The chief bends in from the opposite corner, stern brow easing in recognition. Youbai hovers upside-down directly above the trough, suddenly understanding his old viewing error. One strong circular gesture, simple solid stone form, no readable text, no ceremonial map display.","mood":"A clever visual click and a barrier lowering.","key_moment":"把拓样转半圈才对上旧水槽，幽白的悬浮视角成为既合理又好笑的破局点。","camera":"Overhead-leaning close-medium view of hero rotating the rubbing beside the actual trough; chief leans in from on)MAINSTORY"),
TEXT(R"MAINSTORY(e edge and spirit peers upside-down from above.","facts":["用可核对的旧事取得入寨许可","以旧水槽与刻痕为旁证取得入寨许可。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S04_02.T_Story_S04_02"}},{"id":"S04-03","title":"一步一酒入寨门","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"迎客酒端到面前，你却把满碗往回推了半寸。首领要听的不是豪言，是你敢不敢坦白自己酒量差。","script_revision":2,"objective":"礼貌应答迎客礼，保持清醒记路","requires_all":["S04-02"],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["tusi","入寨喝迎客酒。一步一碗，你敢不敢？"],["hero","敢讲实话。我酒量浅，喝倒了还得劳烦你们抬。"],["you_bai","少侠，这气势是不是略显——"],["hero","清醒。咱们来认水路，不是给水路添个醉鬼。"],["narrator","你把满碗轻轻推回，只留一小口。首领看了片刻，自己先笑出了声。"],["tusi","上回那位连喝三碗，连自己姓什么都编得响亮。你肯说不能，反倒好。"],["hero","礼领了，酒少些。等事情办妥，再好好致谢。"],["tusi","成。清醒进寨，清醒办事。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意礼貌应答迎客礼，保持清醒记路。","这一步要做的是：礼貌应答迎客礼，保持清醒记路。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：完成迎客礼，清醒入寨，得以继续调查旧图。"],"result":"完成迎客礼，清醒入寨，得以继续调查旧图。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":25},"art":{"node_id":"S04-03","file":"s04_03_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["tusi","hero","you_bai"],"scene":"At a modest village entry table, hero gently slides a brimming small earthen wine bowl back across the surface with two fingers, keeping only a tiny tasting cup. Across him the Tusi chief breaks into a broad surprised laugh, orange cape opening with his shoulders. Youbai hovers beside the hero with a halted pompous expression. The visual action is an honest refusal respected, not drinking intoxication. Only two bowls, no banquet clutter, no coin exchange.","mood":"Warm release after a social test, confident rather than boastful.","key_moment":"主角坦然推回满碗，首领由审视转为大笑，信任来自承认能力边界。","camera":"Low table-rim close shot, hero's fingertip gently slides a large cup away; chief's open laughing posture rises behind it while hero stays composed in profile.","facts":["礼貌应答迎客礼，保持清醒记路","完成迎客礼，清醒入寨，得以继续调查旧图。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S04_03.T_Story_S04_03"}},{"id":"S04-04","title":"逛逛寨子","kind":"JourneyInvestigation","summary":"宋金宝来求找牛，村民来催找水。两件急事撞在一处，你低头一看：新蹄印和旧渠，偏偏朝着同一个方向。","script_revision":2,"objective":"进入2-2巡查寨外，核实牛迹与断水线索","requires_all":["S04-03"],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["song_jin_bao","少侠，先找牛！牛回不来，我家明天就只剩我能拉犁了。"],["tusi","田里也断着水。你们查旧道，顺道把渠看清。"],["hero","先别争顺序。牛最后往哪走，水又在哪儿停？"],["narrator","湿地上有新牛蹄印，低处旧渠里还传来水声。两条线都指向寨外同一片洼地。"],["you_bai","一个有蹄，一个没脚，倒比咱们先约上了。"],["song_jin_bao","那快走！"],["hero","先认准线索。追高处干沟，牛和水都不会陪我们爬坡。"],["tusi","带人从低处巡查。找到什么说什么，别急着给谁定罪。"]],"options":[{"text":"沿新牛蹄印与有水声的低处旧渠巡查","correct":true,"feedback":"两条线索指向同一片低处，寻牛与查水都能沿这趟旅程继续。"},{"text":"只沿新挖的高坡干沟找","correct":false,"feedback":"这沟修得有野心，但没有水，也没有新牛印。"},{"text":"先按宋金宝欠条的厚度推算牛的位置","correct":false,"feedback":"幽白沉默片刻：这门学问，本座也帮不上忙。还是看现场。"}],"hints":["把牛走过的痕迹和水流留下的痕迹对照。","新蹄印在湿泥上，旁边低处旧渠有水声，两者指向同一片地方。","选择‘沿新牛蹄印与有水声的低处旧渠巡查’。"],"result":"寨外巡查完成，确认牛迹与旧水渠通往同一片低洼处，寻牛和查水分支开放。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":10,"normal_boxes":10,"box_level":25},"art":{"node_id":"S04-04","file":"s04_04_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["song_jin_bao","hero","tusi","you_bai"],"scene":"At the village edge before the investigation, Song Jinbao and the Tusi chief point in competing directions over the hero's shoulders. Hero kneels and lays his bamboo pole along fresh broad hoofprints beside a low old irrigation channel, revealing BOTH tracks go toward the same hollow. Youbai looks down at the convergence. No cow visible yet, no restored water, no excavation. Clear triangular blocking and two simple directional ground shapes, exact distinct red-orange costumes for Song and chief.","mood":"Busy comic urgency becoming a focused shared plan.","key_moment":"找牛与查水两拨手势相撞，主角把两人的注意力一起引到同向的牛迹与旧渠。","camera":"Three-quarter overhead at a path fork; chief and Song point across each other at the top while hero kneels below placing his pole along converging hoofprints and channel.","facts":["进入2-2巡查寨外，核实牛迹与断水线索","寨外巡查完成，确认牛迹与旧水渠通往同一片低洼处，寻牛和查水分支开放。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S04_04.T_Story_S04_04"}},{"id":"S04-05","title":"牛牛去哪／枯田引流","kind":"Investigation","summary":"宋金宝把失牛想得凄惨，牛却在渠边吃得从容。它抬头嚼了一口，旁边真正堵水的竹篱这才露出来。","script_revision":2,"objective":"循牛迹找到失牛，并辨认旁边的堵水杂物","requires_all":["S04-04"],"requires_any":[],"optional":true,"inside_journey":true,"lines":[["song_jin_bao","我牛呢？不会叫水冲走了吧！"],["narrator","低岸草丛里，牛慢悠悠抬起头，嘴边还挂着一束草。宋金宝的急话噎在了喉咙里。"],["hero","它这顿饭，吃得比咱们稳。先别惊它。"],["you_bai","牛找到了。水口那团东西又是什么？"],["narrator","牛身旁的渠口卡着倒下的竹篱与杂物，水被挡在后面；干岸就在近侧。"],["song_jin_bao","我还以为它堵着水……原来它是来吃席的。"],["hero","把牛慢慢牵到干岸，再看清篱笆怎么卡住。别把绳和渠缠在一起。"],["song_jin_bao","成。牛先安稳，我再腾手帮忙。"]],"options":[{"text":"先牵牛上干岸，再确认竹篱杂物堵住的渠口","correct":true,"feedback":"牛找回来了，断水原因也找对了；两件难题终于有了同一处答案。"},{"text":"认定是牛堵河，先和牛讲道理","correct":false,"feedback":"牛听完慢慢嚼了一口草。它没有接任河神的意思。"},{"text":"把旁边所有沟都再挖深一些","correct":false,"feedback":"先找到真正的堵点，别把调查做成全寨土方工程。"}],"hints":["牛站在浅滩，真正的渠口在旁边。","落下的竹篱、竹枝和杂物才挡住小渠；先把牛牵到干岸。","选择‘先牵牛上干岸，再确认竹篱杂物堵住的渠口’。"],"result":"沿牛迹找到失牛，确认真正堵水的是竹篱与杂物，牛被安全牵回干岸。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":25},"art":{"node_id":"S04-05","file":"s04_05_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["song_jin_bao","hero","you_bai"],"scene":"At the low canal bank, one calm sturdy brown village cow lifts its head with a single big tuft of grass in its mouth. Song Jinbao in exact pointed hat and red coat stops abruptly, leaning back with both palms open in astonishment at how unconcerned it is. Hero reaches calmly toward the loose lead rope while looking past the cow at ONE lodged bamboo fence panel blocking the inlet. Youbai observes the contrast. Cow on stable bank, no distress or drowning, no water restored yet.","mood":"Anxious expectation punctured by the animal's magnificent indifference.","key_moment":"焦急找牛的人急刹在悠闲咀嚼的牛面前，牛让开视线后暴露真正的堵水物。","camera":"Cow's broad head in near foreground chewing across the frame, Song skids to a halt behind it, hero looks past its shoulder toward the lodged fence.","facts":["循牛迹找到失牛，并辨认旁边的堵水杂物","沿牛迹找到失牛，确认真正堵水的是竹篱与杂物，牛被安全牵回干岸。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S04_05.T_Story_S04_05"}},{"id":"S04-06","title":"流向推演／暗河开凿","kind":"Investigation","summary":"宋金宝挽起袖子，准备挖一条惊天暗河。你拦住第一锄：真正该开的出口，就藏在脚边这块旧篱笆下面。","script_revision":2,"objective":"辨认低处旧出口，恢复被遮蔽的引水通道","requires_all":["S04-04"],"requires_any":[],"optional":true,"inside_journey":true,"lines":[["song_jin_bao","我想好了！从上面劈开一道新渠，名儿都想好了，就叫——"],["hero","先别命名。你脚边的旧出口，还堵着。"],["narrator","高处土干，低处有旧水痕。倒下的竹篱横卡在出口，后面的水正找缝隙往外挤。"],["you_bai","你的暗河大计，可能输给一抬手。"],["song_jin_bao","那也得抬得漂亮。"],["hero","漂亮不如站稳。沿原坡度清开，别乱挖坏渠岸。"],["song_jin_bao","行，我扶篱笆，你看水。牛在旁边那片干草地，也没跑远。"],["hero","人、水、牛都有着落，再下手。"]],"options":[{"text":"清开低处旧出口，沿原坡度恢复引水","correct":true,"feedback":"旧水道通了，水顺势回到田渠，调查结果与牛迹也对上。"},{"text":"朝水声最响的岩壁一直凿","correct":false,"feedback":"幽白提醒：咱们补的是舆图，不是给山开天窗。先认旧出口。"},{"text":"把水引向更高的新沟","correct":false,"feedback":"这方案需要水先学轻功，眼下还是尊重地势。"}],"hints":["水要沿低处走，旧出口的位置比声音大小更重要。","被倒竹篱遮住的低处旧出口，才与原田渠相连。","选择‘清开低处旧出口，沿原坡度恢复引水’。"],"result":"恢复低处旧引水口，确认水与牛的去向，农田重新得到水。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":25},"art":{"node_id":"S04-06","file":"s04_06_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["hero","song_jin_bao","you_bai"],"scene":"At the instant the old low water outlet is successfully cleared, hero lifts one simple bamboo fence panel while Song Jinbao braces its other side. A controlled broad ribbon of water runs through along the original slope and splashes Song's fancy red-orange coat hem; he comically pulls the hem up with his spare hand, still helping. Youbai watches with a dry amused look; one calm cow is a small distinct shape on the adjacent dry grassy bank. No huge excavation, no flood, no dense spray particles.","mood":"Practical work defeats grand talk, with a harmless splash of comeuppance.","key_moment":"宏大的挖河计划被脚边旧出口打断；清开篱笆时一股水泼湿宋金宝的花哨衣摆。","camera":"Low diag)MAINSTORY"),
TEXT(R"MAINSTORY(onal action across the opened inlet; hero steadies the fence panel while Song jerks his coat hem away from one broad splash.","facts":["辨认低处旧出口，恢复被遮蔽的引水通道","恢复低处旧引水口，确认水与牛的去向，农田重新得到水。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S04_06.T_Story_S04_06"}},{"id":"S04-07","title":"牛来","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"牛回寨，水也回田。宋金宝正想先把自己藏起来，牛却循着首领手里的青草，把他连人带绳推到了跟前。","script_revision":2,"objective":"向寨中交付寻牛与水路调查结果","requires_all":[],"requires_any":["S04-05","S04-06"],"optional":false,"inside_journey":true,"lines":[["narrator","失牛牵回寨中，旧渠也已通水。大家把沿途查到的堵口和牛迹一一对上，消息终于落了实。"],["tusi","牛回了，田里也见水了。宋金宝，人怎么还往后躲？"],["song_jin_bao","我站后头，显得功劳谦虚些。"],["narrator","牛闻到首领手中的青草，轻轻顶着宋金宝的背，把他推到了众人面前。"],["you_bai","这牛对你的谦虚，另有安排。"],["song_jin_bao","我认，我先前顾着着急，没把渠口查清。欠下的活，我接着干。"],["hero","线索查清了，往后常看旧入口。牛吃草，渠通水，各归各的正经路。"],["tusi","好。话说到这份上，羊皮卷可以拿出来了。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意向寨中交付寻牛与水路调查结果。","这一步要做的是：向寨中交付寻牛与水路调查结果。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：失牛安全回寨，旧水道恢复，寨中确认调查结果。"],"result":"失牛安全回寨，旧水道恢复，寨中确认调查结果。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":25},"art":{"node_id":"S04-07","file":"s04_07_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["song_jin_bao","hero","you_bai","tusi"],"scene":"Back in the village after cow and water problems are solved, a calm brown cow nudges Song Jinbao gently in the back with its forehead as it reaches for a tuft of grass held by the chief ahead. Song shuffles forward off-balance, pointed hat tilted, trying to preserve dignity; hero to the side manages the slack rope with an amused attentive expression, Youbai laughs above. Strong single left-to-right movement, not a posed return-the-cow photo. No dangerous butting, no injuries, one cow only.","mood":"An affectionate physical punchline that brings accountability into the open.","key_moment":"想躲开首领的宋金宝，被牛顶着背送到首领面前，动物自然行为造成喜剧转折。","camera":"Lateral comic procession: cow behind, bent-forward Song in the middle, chief holding grass ahead; hero holds the slack lead rope from the lower side.","facts":["向寨中交付寻牛与水路调查结果","失牛安全回寨，旧水道恢复，寨中确认调查结果。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S04_07.T_Story_S04_07"}},{"id":"S04-08","title":"土司羊皮卷","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"羊皮卷上的怪兽让幽白精神一振，首领却把卷子翻了面：正经的水路在背后，前面那只是先人闲时画的牛。","script_revision":2,"objective":"核对羊皮卷上的寨道与引水记号","requires_all":["S04-07"],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":true,"lines":[["you_bai","这角，这阵势！莫非是什么镇寨异兽图？"],["tusi","我祖父画的牛。小时候画得有些用力。"],["hero","那寨道和水路呢？"],["narrator","首领把羊皮卷翻过来，背面露出清楚的渠线、寨道与几处修补记号。"],["tusi","在这面。前头叫你记得住，后头才叫你走得明白。"],["you_bai","本座方才只是鉴赏画风。"],["hero","我按刚查过的水口核对，把路线抄进自己的图。原卷仍留寨里。"],["tusi","正是。祖传不等于不让改，也不等于让人带走。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意核对羊皮卷上的寨道与引水记号。","这一步要做的是：核对羊皮卷上的寨道与引水记号。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：获得羊皮卷的核对记录，将寨道与引水资料抄入自己的舆图。"],"result":"获得羊皮卷的核对记录，将寨道与引水资料抄入自己的舆图。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":25},"art":{"node_id":"S04-08","file":"s04_08_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["tusi","hero","you_bai"],"scene":"The Tusi chief flips a flexible sheep-hide sheet in one broad motion: its curling front bears a simple comically exaggerated cow pictogram, while the turning back reveals a few practical river and path lines. Youbai's excited face freezes in recognition; hero leans back to let the rolling sheet pass, brush poised over his own separate notebook. No readable writing, no glowing runes, no magical beast materializing. Keep the sheepskin in the chief's hands, original stays in the village.","mood":"A compact visual reversal, fond of ancestors without treating every mark as sacred.","key_moment":"被当成神秘异兽的夸张牛画翻过去，背面才是真正实用的寨道水图。","camera":"Bold scroll-flip close composition, one curled edge reveals the plain canal drawing while a small exaggerated cow doodle folds away; chief's wrist turn drives the action.","facts":["核对羊皮卷上的寨道与引水记号","获得羊皮卷的核对记录，将寨道与引水资料抄入自己的舆图。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S04_08.T_Story_S04_08"}},{"id":"S04-09","title":"土司寨遗痕","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"旧图说寨门在山北，如今的炊烟却在山南。首领没有替图辩解，只说了一句：人搬家，图也得跟着搬。","script_revision":2,"objective":"将寨中旧物与沿途碑记对应","requires_all":["S04-08"],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":true,"lines":[["hero","永州碑记记的是北边旧址，羊皮卷也从那儿起笔。可咱们一路进的是南寨。"],["tusi","水口变了，人就跟着挪。祖先留的地方，不一定够后人一直住。"],["you_bai","难怪那只旧水槽也不在原处。"],["narrator","首领用木杖指过北坡旧墙，再转向南边升起的一缕炊烟。两处相隔不远，却是两代人的日子。"],["hero","那我把旧址与现寨分别标清，注明迁移。不能让赶路人对着空门敲半天。"],["tusi","苍山方向也照如今能走的旧道记，别抄那条荒了的山线。"],["you_bai","听明白了。图得跟着人过日子。"],["hero","接上了。下一程，苍山。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意将寨中旧物与沿途碑记对应。","这一步要做的是：将寨中旧物与沿途碑记对应。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：寨地与前章碑记相互印证，获得前往苍山的明确线索。"],"result":"寨地与前章碑记相互印证，获得前往苍山的明确线索。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":25},"art":{"node_id":"S04-09","file":"s04_09_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["hero","you_bai","tusi"],"scene":"From a broad safe overlook, the Tusi chief sweeps his forked staff from one abandoned low wall on the north slope toward a small inhabited village roof with ONE curling smoke shape on the south. Hero in rear three-quarter profile follows the gesture, notebook tucked under an arm; Youbai stays near the old-wall side, reflecting. Spacious ivory valley, only two essential landscape masses. The contrast of old site and living settlement is the story, not detailed scenery or a row of map readers.","mood":"Reflective perspective, acknowledging change without tragedy.","key_moment":"首领的杖从废旧寨墙划向新寨炊烟，空间里同时看见过去与现在。","camera":"Expansive rear three-quarter overlook, figures small on the lower edge, chief's staff bridges an empty ruined wall at one side and a single village roof-and-smoke silhouette at the other.","facts":["将寨中旧物与沿途碑记对应","寨地与前章碑记相互印证，获得前往苍山的明确线索。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S04_09.T_Story_S04_09"}},{"id":"S04-10","title":"祝酒送别","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"送别酒刚举起，牛便冲你篓边的青草伸长了脖子。你护图，宋金宝护绳，首领笑着把祝词缩成了两个字：拿稳。","script_revision":2,"objective":"告别土司寨，带着核实后的舆图继续上路","requires_all":["S04-09"],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":true,"lines":[["tusi","临行一口，祝你们山路——"],["narrator","牛闻见行篓旁的一撮青草，伸长脖子。你立刻护住图袋，宋金宝忙把牵绳收稳。"],["song_jin_bao","别吃！人家这是去苍山，不是送草到家！"],["hero","前辈，你的祝词先等等，我这儿有位听众比较饿。"],["tusi","那便说短些：拿稳。路上拿稳，心里也拿稳。"],["you_bai","这回少说几句，倒句句在路上。"],["hero","图记清了，人也记住了。以后有新的变动，烦请留个口信。"],["tusi","好。下回进寨，仍得问来意。不过，门杖可以先放一边。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意告别土司寨，带着核实后的舆图继续上路。","这一步要做的是：告别土司寨，带着核实后的舆图继续上路。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：完成寨中送别，土司寨主干结束，启程前往苍山。"],"result":"完成寨中送别，土司寨主干结束，启程前往苍山。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":25},"art":{"node_id":"S04-10","file":"s04_10_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["tusi","hero","song_jin_bao","you_bai"],"scene":"At the open village gate, the hero turns his bamboo basket away from a curious cow's reaching nose to protect his closed map pouch. Song Jinbao gathers the loose lead rope while the Tusi chief pauses a toast, laughing over a tiny earthen cup; Youbai floats clear of the commotion. ONE tuft of grass tied outside the basket explains the cow's interest. Friendly spontaneous movement and an open doorway, no banquet tables, no giant reward piles, no animal violence.","mood":"Relaxed communal comedy, an earned opposite to the tense arrival.","key_moment":"庄重祝词被牛的胃口打断，众人各护其物，却已完全没有初入寨时的隔阂。","camera":"Loose diagonal farewell action, hero rotating basket away from reaching cow nose, Song gathers rope low in foreground, chief holds one small cup high with a laugh.","facts":["告别土司寨，带着核实后的舆图继续上路","完成寨中送别，土司寨主干结束，启程前往苍山。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S04_10.T_Story_S04_10"}},{"id":"S04-11","title":"寨前受挟","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"首领讲起从前受骗，没把丢脸的部分省掉。那张骗钱宝图如今垫在短桌腿下，至少终于有了一点实用价值。","script_revision":2,"objective":"了解寨门盘问背后的顾虑","requires_all":["S04-02"],"requires_any":[],"optional":true,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["hero","门前那番盘问，看来真有旧事)MAINSTORY"),
TEXT(R"MAINSTORY(。"],["tusi","有。我当年也信过说得响的人，还夸人家见识广。"],["you_bai","后来那张宝图呢？"],["narrator","首领抬了抬一张矮桌，桌腿下露出折得厚厚的一角纸。"],["tusi","在这儿。认路不行，垫桌倒稳。修渠钱追回了一部分，剩下的教训我自己记着。"],["hero","肯把受骗的事说出来，也算给后来的人留个提醒。"],["tusi","所以我问证据，也给人解释的机会。不能受过一次骗，就把所有来客都当贼。"],["you_bai","这份分寸，比嗓门难学。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意了解寨门盘问背后的顾虑。","这一步要做的是：了解寨门盘问背后的顾虑。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：理解寨中盘问的缘由，记下以证据建立信任的经验。"],"result":"理解寨中盘问的缘由，记下以证据建立信任的经验。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":25},"art":{"node_id":"S04-11","file":"s04_11_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["tusi","hero","you_bai"],"scene":"In a modest village porch, the chief lifts one corner of a small uneven table to show a tightly folded old fake map being used to level the short leg. Hero bends from one side with a surprised half-smile, Youbai peers at almost floor height. The chief is amused at his own past mistake, not raging. Paper shows a few non-text pictorial lines only. Strong low reveal, mostly plain floor and ivory space, no treasury scene.","mood":"Self-deprecating honesty and thoughtful trust.","key_moment":"首领掀桌露出垫脚的假宝图，自嘲把先前强硬背后的经验与分寸说开。","camera":"Very low comic reveal beneath the table, folded fake map under one short leg; chief's large hand lifts the corner while hero bends to see, spirit peeks from floor level.","facts":["了解寨门盘问背后的顾虑","理解寨中盘问的缘由，记下以证据建立信任的经验。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S04_11.T_Story_S04_11"}},{"id":"S04-12","title":"寨中风雨","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"宋金宝一身讲究，却肯把最漂亮的衣边拆来补牵牛绳。那头牛不只是家产，也拴着家里明年的饭。","script_revision":2,"objective":"听宋金宝讲家中困境与失牛缘由","requires_all":["S04-03"],"requires_any":[],"optional":true,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["song_jin_bao","我平时说话有点花，这次是真没招了。牛丢了，家里的地怎么办？"],["hero","你手里剪的是什么？"],["narrator","宋金宝拆下一截漂亮衣边，仔细缠住磨损的牵绳，借着牙齿咬紧绳结。"],["song_jin_bao","绳老了，早该换。总想着再省一天，这下省出大事了。"],["you_bai","衣裳倒舍得拆。"],["song_jin_bao","衣裳少一边，还能见人。家里少了牛，明年饭都得见底。"],["hero","先说最后的牛迹。沿旧渠那片低地，我们一起查。"],["song_jin_bao","好。找回来，我换根结实的。这截花边，算我先认错。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意听宋金宝讲家中困境与失牛缘由。","这一步要做的是：听宋金宝讲家中困境与失牛缘由。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：了解宋金宝的处境与牛沿旧渠离开的线索，约定共同调查。"],"result":"了解宋金宝的处境与牛沿旧渠离开的线索，约定共同调查。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":25},"art":{"node_id":"S04-12","file":"s04_12_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["song_jin_bao","hero","you_bai"],"scene":"At a simple village step, Song Jinbao leans forward repairing a worn cattle lead with a strip removed from the decorative hem of his own red-orange coat. He holds the rope end lightly between his teeth while both hands tighten the knot, focused rather than posing. Hero crouches lower at his side listening; Youbai looks at the newly missing coat trim with surprise. No cow present yet, no returned-animal celebration, no piles of debt slips. One practical action reveals care beneath vanity.","mood":"Human and slightly awkward, showing responsibility through a small sacrifice.","key_moment":"花哨的宋金宝咬紧绳结，把华服的一角拆给牵牛绳，表明他真正看重什么。","camera":"Tight oblique seated-working shot, Song leans forward with rope clenched carefully in teeth and hands twisting cloth, hero crouches at a different angle to listen.","facts":["听宋金宝讲家中困境与失牛缘由","了解宋金宝的处境与牛沿旧渠离开的线索，约定共同调查。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S04_12.T_Story_S04_12"}}]},{"id":"S05","title":"苍山·登顶以后嘴也别停","summary":"最后一段路遇见琼幺儿，风雪替豪言壮语降温。把旧抄本与亲见的山川合在一起，给这趟求证留个能继续往下写的结尾。","stage_number":6,"mainline_end":"S05-10","nodes":[{"id":"S05-01","title":"苍山脚下","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"苍山把云顶在头上，幽白把气势顶在脸上。你把衣领拢紧，决定先看看哪一样更抗风。","script_revision":1,"objective":"确认上山路线与风雪变化","requires_all":[],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["hero","前面就是苍山？看着比旧图上画得高。"],["you_bai","纸张有限，名山适当收敛了一下。"],["hero","山没收敛，我的腿倒先谦虚了。"],["narrator","山脚有人行旧道通往古寨，高处的雪线时隐时现。你们决定先问熟悉山路的人。"],["you_bai","这回本座赞成先问再走。经验之谈。"],["hero","进步很大，天台山那座桥听了都欣慰。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意确认上山路线与风雪变化。","这一步要做的是：确认上山路线与风雪变化。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：确认先沿旧道到古寨问路，准备应对高处风雪。"],"result":"确认先沿旧道到古寨问路，准备应对高处风雪。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":30},"art":{"node_id":"S05-01","file":"s05_01_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["hero","you_bai"],"scene":"At the foot of Cangshan the exact hero takes one well-planted uphill step on a broad old trail, firmly tucking his crossed collar with one hand. His basket tilts naturally with his turning shoulder. Beside him Youbai attempts a dignified face while its flame tip streams horizontally in the same wind as the hero's head ribbon. Closed map safely tucked at belt, not held open. Two very faint mountain planes and a small village roof give depth and a distant snowline; no snow emergency or summit yet.","mood":"Brisk comic arrival, the enormous mountain gently punctures their bravado.","key_moment":"豪言未出口，幽白先被山风吹成一面小旗，主角拢紧衣领沿旧道进寨。","camera":"Low uphill rear three-quarter view: large quiet foreground path sweeps toward a small distant porch, hero glances sideways at wind-flattened spirit.","facts":["确认上山路线与风雪变化","确认先沿旧道到古寨问路，准备应对高处风雪。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S05_01.T_Story_S05_01"}},{"id":"S05-02","title":"苗族古寨","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"寨里姑娘听完你的来意，先看了看图，又看了看幽白，表示这趟队伍的热闹程度已经达标。","script_revision":1,"objective":"结识琼幺儿，询问鹰喙岩与上山路","requires_all":["S05-01"],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["qiong_yao_er","我是琼幺儿。你们去找鹰喙岩？先别让这团火替你们决定方向。"],["you_bai","本座的名声，怎么已经传到这里了？"],["hero","不是名声，是你刚才盯着雪峰说‘那条近’。"],["qiong_yao_er","近不近看路，险不险看天。等风小些，我把认岩和过潭的线索讲给你们。"],["hero","好。有当地人带路，心里踏实。"],["qiong_yao_er","我先负责讲清楚，你负责认真听。别给自己的勇气加戏。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意结识琼幺儿，询问鹰喙岩与上山路。","这一步要做的是：结识琼幺儿，询问鹰喙岩与上山路。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：结识琼幺儿，得到等待风雪减弱与核对鹰喙岩的指引。"],"result":"结识琼幺儿，得到等待风雪减弱与核对鹰喙岩的指引。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":30},"art":{"node_id":"S05-02","file":"s05_02_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["qiong_yao_er","you_bai","hero"],"scene":"At the open mountain village porch, Qiong Yaoer has just lifted her small bell HANDLE to point past Youbai toward a winding old road around the slope. The bell does not touch the spirit. Hero stands one step lower outside, one hand on his basket strap, amusedly watching the spirit turn from the apparently close snowy peak to the actually usable path. Qiong leans lightly on the porch post, confident dry humor, no equipment handover. One broad doorway shape frames different depths, two faint landmark silhouettes, no active blizzard.","mood":"Lighthearted Chinese wuxia comedy, relaxed relief after a small success.","key_moment":"幽白朝着近在眼前的雪峰昂首，琼幺儿用铃柄把视线轻轻引回真正的山路。","camera":"From inside a village doorway, Qiong foreground in three-quarter profile, hero outside at lower step, small spirit turning between snow peak and curving road.","facts":["结识琼幺儿，询问鹰喙岩与上山路","结识琼幺儿，得到等待风雪减弱与核对鹰喙岩的指引。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S05_02.T_Story_S05_02"}},{"id":"S05-03","title":"暴风避雪","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"风雪一紧，三人躲到檐下。幽白说高手懂得审时度势，你说普通人也懂得不站着挨冻。","script_revision":1,"objective":"等待风势减弱，核对出发时机","requires_all":["S05-02"],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["narrator","刚才山风骤紧，三人退回结实屋檐下。旧图被压在石块下，谁也没急着往白茫茫里走。"],["you_bai","此乃以静制动。"],["hero","我叫它先躲躲。"],["qiong_yao_er","两个名字都行，别给等天气这件事吵出个门派。"],["narrator","片刻后，近处松梢不再急摇，石阶边线重新可辨。琼幺儿示意可以沿旧道谨慎前行。"],["hero","风肯讲道理了，我们也别突然不讲。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意等待风势减弱，核对出发时机。","这一步要做的是：等待风势减弱，核对出发时机。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：安全避过骤紧风雪，在旧道可辨后继续行程。"],"result":"安全避过骤紧风雪，在旧道可辨后继续行程。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":30},"art":{"node_id":"S05-03","file":"s05_03_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["you_bai","hero","qiong_yao_er"],"scene":"All three remain safely inside a sturdy village porch as the worst gust p)MAINSTORY"),
TEXT(R"MAINSTORY(asses. Qiong lifts one edge of a plain hanging wind cloth with her left hand to inspect the reappearing old stone path. Hero sits farther back on a simple wooden bench warming his hands, shoulders tucked, looking toward the opening; his intact folded-open map is firmly weighted under one small stone beside him. Youbai hovers upright near his cheek, trying to look strategic. Sparse large snow streaks outside only, no shower of dots, visible firm stairs, no rushing into a blizzard.","mood":"Lighthearted Chinese wuxia comedy, relaxed relief after a small success.","key_moment":"风刚松口，琼幺儿掀开挡风帘确认石阶；主角仍捂着手，幽白的‘以静制动’还没说完。","camera":"Shelter interior looking diagonally out under one lifted cloth edge; warm compact group against a wide cool band of clearing weather.","facts":["等待风势减弱，核对出发时机","安全避过骤紧风雪，在旧道可辨后继续行程。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S05_03.T_Story_S05_03"}},{"id":"S05-04","title":"定位鹰喙岩","kind":"Investigation","summary":"两块岩石都觉得自己像鹰，真正那块倒没空争辩，安安静静对着旧道。","script_revision":1,"objective":"结合岩形、旧道与松树位置认出鹰喙岩","requires_all":["S05-03"],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["qiong_yao_er","鹰喙岩向外挑出一角，下面接旧石道，旁边有一棵弯向山谷的老松。三样合起来认。"],["you_bai","那边那块也像鹰。"],["hero","你看馒头也像名山，先按线索来。"],["narrator","左前方岩角外挑，旧道贴着岩下延伸，老松向谷侧弯着。右方孤石形似鸟头，四周却没有路。"],["qiong_yao_er","像什么只是第一眼，能不能与地势对上才要紧。"]],"options":[{"text":"认左前方同时对应旧道和老松的外挑岩角","correct":true,"feedback":"岩形、道路与老松三处吻合，鹰喙岩定位成功。"},{"text":"只挑最像鸟头的右方孤石","correct":false,"feedback":"它像鹰不假，可它旁边没路。别把欣赏奇石当赶路方案。"},{"text":"听幽白选，看它哪边夸得响","correct":false,"feedback":"琼幺儿轻轻摇铃：这条线索只有音量，没有方向。"}],"hints":["把岩石形状与旁边的道路、老松一起核对。","真正的鹰喙岩同时有外挑岩角、岩下旧道和向山谷弯的老松。","选择‘认左前方同时对应旧道和老松的外挑岩角’。"],"result":"认出连接旧道与老松的鹰喙岩，安全定位后续路线。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":30},"art":{"node_id":"S05-04","file":"s05_04_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["qiong_yao_er","you_bai","hero"],"scene":"Hero crouches securely on the broad old stone trail, one knee down, using the straight bamboo pole as a low sightline toward the outward projecting rock and a bent pine beside its base. He is NOT aiming a weapon. Qiong a few paces farther along looks back while indicating the continuous trail with her open hand. Youbai turns away from a faint disconnected birdlike boulder across the valley. Show the correct rock overhang, bent pine and connected old path as three clear simple shapes. Firm ground, no cliff leap; map rolled away.","mood":"Lighthearted Chinese wuxia comedy, relaxed relief after a small success.","key_moment":"主角蹲低把岩角、老松与旧道对成一线，琼幺儿顺着这条真路线领走，幽白只好告别那块‘很像鹰’的孤石。","camera":"Low sightline along a secure curving stone path beneath one broad overhang; main cast at staggered distances, a faint isolated wrong rock far away.","facts":["结合岩形、旧道与松树位置认出鹰喙岩","认出连接旧道与老松的鹰喙岩，安全定位后续路线。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S05_04.T_Story_S05_04"}},{"id":"S05-05","title":"洗马潭","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"潭面照着云，你的旧图照着过去。幽白说二者都很有意境，琼幺儿说看路时先别忙着作诗。","script_revision":1,"objective":"核对潭边旧路与稳定通行处","requires_all":["S05-04"],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["hero","潭边这一段，旧图画得太直，实际得沿石岸绕一下。"],["qiong_yao_er","贴着稳固的旧道走，别贪近踩薄雪。山路最爱教嘴硬的人重新做人。"],["you_bai","本座没有脚，暂不参加这门课程。"],["hero","那麻烦你照清楚，给有脚的同学一点帮助。"],["narrator","三人核对潭边地势，正要沿旧道前行，前方转折处忽然传来兽群逼近的动静。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意核对潭边旧路与稳定通行处。","这一步要做的是：核对潭边旧路与稳定通行处。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：修正潭边绕行路线，发现前方有需要处理的险情。"],"result":"修正潭边绕行路线，发现前方有需要处理的险情。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":30},"art":{"node_id":"S05-05","file":"s05_05_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["hero","qiong_yao_er","you_bai"],"scene":"A broad curved stone bank creates a strong C around calm pale tarn water. Hero pauses midway through a well-planted step on the verified path, brush and notebook tucked away, suddenly turning his head toward a hidden bend. Qiong farther along has stopped and raised one compact wait gesture; Youbai, which had floated a straighter line just over the bank, also turns sharply. Thin snow only off the firm route, not a hazardous snow crossing. No visible attacking animals or rescue outcome yet. Clear wide water shape, one large bank mass, no granular foam.","mood":"Lighthearted Chinese wuxia comedy, relaxed relief after a small success.","key_moment":"幽白顺着直线飘，两个有脚的人沿石岸绕；转弯处的动静让轻松的队伍同时停住。","camera":"High oblique view, a single broad C-shaped bank wraps calm tarn, near hero larger, Qiong farther along, spirit above water edge.","facts":["核对潭边旧路与稳定通行处","修正潭边绕行路线，发现前方有需要处理的险情。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S05_05.T_Story_S05_05"}},{"id":"S05-06","title":"英雄救美","kind":"JourneyBattle","summary":"兽群堵住了转折处，琼幺儿护着旧道边的落脚点。幽白催你动手，你表示这次终于轮到正经出力。","script_revision":3,"objective":"进入2-3，在剧情问号处击退兽群，与琼幺儿安全脱险","requires_all":["S05-05"],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["qiong_yao_er","前边窄道堵了，一头灰狼，一只豪猪。稳石在左，别往碎石上冲。"],["hero","今日英雄救美，先保证英雄不滑成笑话。"],["you_bai","本座先把这句话记下。真滑了，好知道笑哪一句。"],["qiong_yao_er","我看住落脚点。等你把前路清开，我们再相互接应。"],["hero","好，先备齐再上。英雄称号晚点领，路得先走稳。"]],"options":[],"hints":["救援需要在对应关卡的剧情问号处完成真实战斗。","使用当前旅程的队伍和卡组，获胜后继续与琼幺儿的剧情。","从本节点进入2-3，在剧情问号处赢下任务战斗。"],"result":"兽群被击退，主角与琼幺儿互相照应安全脱险，前路恢复通行。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":10,"normal_boxes":10,"box_level":30},"art":{"node_id":"S05-06","file":"s05_06_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["qiong_yao_er","hero","you_bai"],"scene":"The decisive cooperative rescue moment by the tarn: hero has both feet planted on a broad firm stone, front knee aligned with foot, sweeping his bamboo pole low and sideways to keep one project gray wolf and one project porcupine retreating toward open ground away from the party. No striking bodies, gore or new weapon. Qiong stands securely one step higher on the continuous old path, knees softly braced, reaching her free hand down ready to help hero negotiate that short step after the animals retreat; her other hand keeps her bell close. Their hands need not already connect. Youbai provides a small distracting flare from the opposite side. Everyone supported, no cliff dangling, no falling rocks, no balancing on an isolated pinnacle. Focus on coordinated action and alert eyelines, broad calm rock planes, actual route clear behind them.","mood":"Resourceful mutual rescue with a lively comic edge, credible balance and support.","key_moment":"主角稳住横竿清开窄道，琼幺儿守住落脚点并伸手接应，两人互相搭把手而不是单向救美。","camera":"Low oblique diagonal across a short stone-path narrowing: hero anchors lower foreground, Qiong braced one step up, cleared path recedes behind them.","facts":["进入2-3，在剧情问号处击退兽群，与琼幺儿安全脱险","兽群被击退，主角与琼幺儿互相照应安全脱险，前路恢复通行。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S05_06.T_Story_S05_06","monster_references":["SourceAssets/RouteEnemies/final_selected_v1/07_graywolf.png","SourceAssets/RouteEnemies/final_selected_v1/10_porcupine.png"]},"after_battle_lines":[["narrator","兽群退入山影。你撑竿站稳，琼幺儿扶了一下你的肩，把你接过松动的石沿。"],["qiong_yao_er","好了。人都站住了，哪位英雄刚才差点把包留在原地？"],["hero","包是诱敌之计。人不是，幸亏你接得快。"],["you_bai","本座记明白了：今日互相救美，双方都有出力。"],["qiong_yao_er","那就谁也别抢功。前路还长，互相搭把手。"]],"enemy_ids":["Enemy.Ch2.GrayWolf","Enemy.Ch2.Porcupine"]},{"id":"S05-07","title":"坚持前行","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"险情过去，山顶还在前面。你把旧图重新摊开，发现自己已经不再只等它给答案。","script_revision":1,"objective":"整理继续登顶的理由与可靠路线","requires_all":["S05-06"],"requires_any":[],"optional":true,"inside_journey":true,"lines":[["hero","都走到这里了，我想把最后这一段亲眼看清。"],["you_bai","很好，少侠当有此志。"],["hero","主要是前面改了这么多，总不能最后一笔又靠猜。"],["qiong_yao_er","那就沿已经核实的旧道继续。坚持不是跟险处较劲，是知道自己为什么往前走。"],["hero","听见了，稳稳地走。豪言壮语先省着，到山顶再用。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意整理继续登顶的理由与可靠路线。","这一步要做的是：整理继续登顶的理由与可靠路线。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：确定沿已核实的安全旧道继续登顶。"],"result":"确定沿已核实的安全旧道继续登顶。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":30},"art":{"node_id":"S05-07","file":"s05_07_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_r)MAINSTORY"),
TEXT(R"MAINSTORY(esult","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["hero","you_bai","qiong_yao_er"],"scene":"After rescue, hero deliberately places his cloth shoe on the NEXT broad secure old stone step, knee naturally bent, bamboo pole planted beside him, closed map safely tucked into basket. Qiong leads only half a pace and looks back with a quiet approving smile. Youbai floats low beside the visible trail rather than racing toward shortcuts. Keep hero face visible in partial turning profile. Wide ivory mountain air and two soft peaks; steady resolve, no charge, leap or dangerous drop.","mood":"Lighthearted Chinese wuxia comedy, relaxed relief after a small success.","key_moment":"主角收好图，踏上亲自核实的下一阶；琼幺儿领先半步回望，幽白这次跟着真路走。","camera":"Ascending rear three-quarter long shot with one near planted shoe and basket silhouette, gentle diagonal trail opening into pale summit air.","facts":["整理继续登顶的理由与可靠路线","确定沿已核实的安全旧道继续登顶。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S05_07.T_Story_S05_07"}},{"id":"S05-08","title":"暗生悔意","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"你承认刚才有一瞬间想下山。幽白还没来得及端架子，琼幺儿先把这句话接住了。","script_revision":1,"objective":"正视害怕，调整步调后继续","requires_all":["S05-06"],"requires_any":[],"optional":true,"inside_journey":true,"lines":[["hero","说实话，方才那阵动静一来，我脑子里已经开始规划回家的饭了。"],["you_bai","这……倒也不算没有规划。"],["qiong_yao_er","怕很正常。先停一停，缓过来，再按能确认的路走。没人规定求真必须全程嘴硬。"],["hero","那我承认，刚才确实慌。现在好多了。"],["you_bai","本座也承认，方才飘得稍微快了些。"],["hero","懂了，咱们一个战术坐下，一个战术飘远。缓好了，继续。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意正视害怕，调整步调后继续。","这一步要做的是：正视害怕，调整步调后继续。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：承认并平复险后的害怕，选择以更稳妥的步调继续前行。"],"result":"承认并平复险后的害怕，选择以更稳妥的步调继续前行。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":30},"art":{"node_id":"S05-08","file":"s05_08_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["hero","you_bai","qiong_yao_er"],"scene":"At a safe sheltered rest rock after rescue, hero sits supported with both shoes flat on the ground and hands loosely resting on knees, giving a rueful embarrassed half-smile. Qiong has crouched comfortably beside him at eye level, patient and warm, no consoling head-pat or forced embrace. Youbai returns close from the open side with an unusually sheepish tilted face. Intact map folded on basket, not displayed between them. Large shelter shadow and soft empty mountain air; honest fear settling into readiness, no abandonment or permanent retreat.","mood":"Quiet human warmth with self-deprecating humor, a necessary breath after action.","key_moment":"嘴硬的大侠先坐下缓口气，琼幺儿把脚步也慢下来，幽白不好意思地飘回身边。","camera":"Intimate near eye-level side shot under one broad shelter rock; hero seated lower, Qiong crouched at conversational height, spirit returning from open side.","facts":["正视害怕，调整步调后继续","承认并平复险后的害怕，选择以更稳妥的步调继续前行。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S05_08.T_Story_S05_08"}},{"id":"S05-09","title":"幽白释疑","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"几章所见终于拼到一起。幽白坦白，自己守了许久的并非一张永远正确的图，而是一件需要人继续做的事。","script_revision":1,"objective":"理解幽白守图的心愿，核对全程证据","requires_all":[],"requires_any":["S05-07","S05-08"],"optional":false,"inside_journey":true,"lines":[["hero","幽白，你明知抄图会有漏笔，怎么一开始还那么笃定？"],["you_bai","守得久了，总想替它多说两句。再说，本座也有面子。"],["hero","你本体除了脸，确实也没剩多少地方能放。"],["you_bai","……但这一路，本座看明白了。守图，不该只守旧墨，还得等愿意亲自看、认真改的人。"],["qiong_yao_er","你们把桥、溪、田渠和寨道都问过、走过。这些才是能留下来的东西。"],["hero","那最后这笔，就写给后面还要走路的人。哪天他们发现错了，也尽管改。"],["you_bai","可以。改的时候，对本座客气一点便是。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意理解幽白守图的心愿，核对全程证据。","这一步要做的是：理解幽白守图的心愿，核对全程证据。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：明白幽白守图的心愿，将六章证据统一为可继续订正的舆图。"],"result":"明白幽白守图的心愿，将六章证据统一为可继续订正的舆图。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":30},"art":{"node_id":"S05-09","file":"s05_09_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["hero","you_bai","qiong_yao_er"],"scene":"On a broad safe upper-mountain ledge, hero kneels comfortably beside a flat stone and lowers his brush toward a blank CORRECTION margin of the intact map. Youbai visibly moves aside from that exact spot, face unusually sincere with a stubborn little smile, providing soft local light without touching or burning paper. Qiong sits farther back with bell quiet in her lap, watching the exchange. Only three simple pictorial rivers/mountains on paper and a generous blank margin; no legible writing, no magic runes, no human transformation, no death or fading-away symbolism. Hero and spirit make direct eye contact just before the stroke.","mood":"Small sincere gesture of trust; warm with an affectionate comic undercurrent.","key_moment":"幽白主动挪开，给主角落笔订正留出位置：守旧图的人终于肯让新墨落下。","camera":"Close oblique viewpoint along the low writing surface, pen hand foreground, flame face near center, Qiong attentive but smaller behind.","facts":["理解幽白守图的心愿，核对全程证据","明白幽白守图的心愿，将六章证据统一为可继续订正的舆图。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S05_09.T_Story_S05_09"},"original_title":"月玉合谲"},{"id":"S05-10","title":"苍山之巅","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"站到山顶再看舆图，纸上已经不只剩旧墨。幽白想发表感言，你决定这次让它说完。","script_revision":1,"objective":"完成苍山末段订正，为行旅续志","requires_all":["S05-09"],"requires_any":[],"optional":false,"inside_journey":true,"lines":[["narrator","苍山云海展开在眼前。旧抄本与一路补记终于对合，溪流、村寨、山道各归其位。"],["hero","祖父说图上不明白的地方，要亲眼看看。现在总算能回他一句：看过了，也改过了。"],["qiong_yao_er","这趟走得值。以后还有人沿着它来，少走冤枉路，多看些真山水。"],["you_bai","本座宣布，此行圆满。少侠腿脚勤勉，偶有顶嘴，整体值得——"],["hero","前辈，感言控制一下。山顶风大，不包返场。"],["you_bai","……值得同行。"],["narrator","你在卷尾添下一句自己的话：先贤之路，非独山水，亦在求真。余下的空白，留给下一段旅程。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意完成苍山末段订正，为行旅续志。","这一步要做的是：完成苍山末段订正，为行旅续志。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：苍山末段订正完成，六章主线收束，舆图留下继续求证的余白。"],"result":"苍山末段订正完成，六章主线收束，舆图留下继续求证的余白。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":30},"art":{"node_id":"S05-10","file":"s05_10_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["hero","qiong_yao_er","you_bai"],"scene":"At the broad SAFE summit, hero sits comfortably on a low flat rock and has just closed his brush after completing the last correction. The map rests securely across his lap with one generous blank end retained for later journeys, not held up for a group photo. Qiong sits on a separate lower stone facing the open cloud sea, turns her head toward the hero with earned quiet joy. Youbai beside them speaks proudly while its flame tip and Qiong's scarf are gently lifted by the same breeze, affectionate light comedy. Faces visible in three-quarter profile, no character at a precipice edge. One plain squat weathered stele nearby, no readable lettering. Broad pale cloud band, two ink peak silhouettes and warm ivory space; everyone alive and together.","mood":"Earned quiet accomplishment, expansive breathing room, affectionate light ending.","key_moment":"最后一笔落下又留白，三人面向云海歇肩；幽白的长篇感言被一阵山风轻轻打短。","camera":"Wide summit panorama seen from slightly behind and beside seated travelers, large quiet foreground map corner leads into expansive cloud sea.","facts":["完成苍山末段订正，为行旅续志","苍山末段订正完成，六章主线收束，舆图留下继续求证的余白。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S05_10.T_Story_S05_10"}},{"id":"S05-11","title":"苗家姑娘","kind":"Dialogue","summary":"琼幺儿的铃声清脆，指路也清楚。幽白问铃有何神通，她说最大的神通是让话多的人知道该停了。","script_revision":1,"objective":"了解琼幺儿与当地识路经验","requires_all":["S05-02"],"requires_any":[],"optional":true,"inside_journey":false,"lines":[["you_bai","姑娘这铃，可辨山灵、引云气？"],["qiong_yao_er","能提醒走散的人，也能提醒话多的人。"],["hero","这件法器很适合我们队。"],["you_bai","本座怎么觉得，第二项功能有所针对？"],["qiong_yao_er","看天色、听风、认旧路，都是人一趟趟走出来的。你们肯把这些写清，我就愿意多讲些。"],["hero","那就多记几笔。铃声留着提醒我们，嘴别跑到脚前头去。"]],"options":[],"hints":["先听清这段交流，留意了解琼幺儿与当地识路经验。","这一步要做的是：了解琼幺儿与当地识路经验。","把本段对话听完并确认结论：听取琼幺儿的识路经验，建立同行默契。"],"result":"听取琼幺儿的识路经验，建立同行默契。","reward":{"gold":100000,"advanced_boxes":0,"normal_boxes":0,"box_level":30},"art":{"node_id":"S05-11","file":"s05_11_v1.png","display_phase":"story_preview_and_result","style_version":"clean_ink_v2","cast":["you_bai","qiong_yao_er","hero"],"scene":"At the mountain village porch before rescue, Qiong gives a tiny casual shake of her bronze hand bell near shoulder height while leaning lightly against a timb)MAINSTORY"),
TEXT(R"MAINSTORY(er post. Youbai immediately pauses with mouth half open and offended eyebrows, looking at the bell; hero farther behind laughs over one raised shoulder, hand on basket strap. Only one very small motion accent beside bell, no magical blast or spell. Preserve Qiong's original beaded cream cap, braid, red-orange jacket, ochre skirt and cream/red scarf; new natural pose. Warm blank backdrop with one porch post and a faint old path, not a crowded inn.","mood":"Lighthearted Chinese wuxia comedy, relaxed relief after a small success.","key_moment":"琼幺儿轻摇小铃，幽白停在半句，主角笑着把注意力从嘴上转回脚下的路。","camera":"Close comic triangular staging from below porch rail, bell foreground normal scale, Qiong on one side and interrupted spirit on other, hero one depth behind.","facts":["了解琼幺儿与当地识路经验","听取琼幺儿的识路经验，建立同行默契。"],"texture":"/Game/GameXXK/UI/StoryNodes/T_Story_S05_11.T_Story_S05_11"}}]}]})MAINSTORY")
};
